WEBVTT

NOTE
Speaker-labeled subtitles generated by tools/label_subtitles.py on 2026-10-06. Labels: subtitle labels, then transcript alignment, then screenplay alignment; unlabeled lines have no voice tag. Local use only; do not commit or distribute.

1
00:02:29.443 --> 00:02:33.071
<v role-pilot>Command station, this is ST-321. Code clearance blue.</v>

2
00:02:33.197 --> 00:02:36.199
<v role-pilot>We're starting our approach. Deactivate the security shield.</v>

3
00:02:36.241 --> 00:02:39.036
<v role-controller>The security deflector shield will be deactivated</v>

4
00:02:39.077 --> 00:02:41.747
<v role-controller>when we have confirmation of your code transmission.</v>

5
00:02:41.788 --> 00:02:42.831
<v role-controller>Stand by.</v>

6
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.084
<v role-controller>You are clear to proceed.</v>

7
00:02:46.126 --> 00:02:47.628
<v role-pilot>We're starting our approach.</v>

8
00:03:15.405 --> 00:03:18.659
<v role-officer>Inform the commander that Lord Vader's shuttle has arrived.</v>

9
00:03:18.951 --> 00:03:20.118
<v role-operator>Sir.</v>

10
00:03:56.655 --> 00:03:58.407
<v jerjerrod>Lord Vader, this is an unexpected pleasure.</v>

11
00:03:58.448 --> 00:03:59.688
<v jerjerrod>We're honored by your presence.</v>

12
00:03:59.783 --> 00:04:02.263
<v vader>You may dispense with the pleasantries, Commander.</v>

13
00:04:02.452 --> 00:04:04.746
<v vader>I'm here to put you back on schedule.</v>

14
00:04:04.788 --> 00:04:08.000
<v jerjerrod>I assure you, Lord Vader, my men are working as fast as they can.</v>

15
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:11.503
<v vader>Perhaps I can find new ways to motivate them.</v>

16
00:04:12.713 --> 00:04:15.841
<v jerjerrod>I tell you this station will be operational, as planned.</v>

17
00:04:16.425 --> 00:04:21.722
<v vader>The Emperor does not share your optimistic appraisal of the situation.</v>

18
00:04:21.763 --> 00:04:25.309
<v jerjerrod>But he asks the impossible. I need more men.</v>

19
00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.478
<v vader>Then perhaps you can tell him when he arrives.</v>

20
00:04:29.604 --> 00:04:31.148
<v jerjerrod>The Emperor's coming here?</v>

21
00:04:31.189 --> 00:04:33.233
<v vader>That is correct, Commander,</v>

22
00:04:33.525 --> 00:04:38.155
<v vader>and he is most displeased with your apparent lack of progress.</v>

23
00:04:38.947 --> 00:04:40.741
<v jerjerrod>We shall double our efforts.</v>

24
00:04:40.782 --> 00:04:44.119
<v vader>I hope so, Commander, for your sake.</v>

25
00:04:44.453 --> 00:04:48.123
<v vader>The Emperor is not as forgiving as I am.</v>

26
00:05:05.974 --> 00:05:08.310
<v c-3po>Of course I'm worried. And you should be, too.</v>

27
00:05:08.352 --> 00:05:12.522
<v c-3po>Lando Calrissian and poor Chewbacca never returned from this awful place.</v>

28
00:05:15.025 --> 00:05:16.651
<v c-3po>Don't be so sure.</v>

29
00:05:17.069 --> 00:05:20.447
<v c-3po>If I told you half the things I've heard about this Jabba the Hutt,</v>

30
00:05:20.489 --> 00:05:21.782
<v c-3po>you'd probably short-circuit.</v>

31
00:05:35.003 --> 00:05:37.839
<v c-3po>R2, are you sure this is the right place?</v>

32
00:05:41.802 --> 00:05:43.386
<v c-3po>I'd better knock, I suppose.</v>

33
00:05:45.972 --> 00:05:49.142
<v c-3po>There doesn't seem to be anyone here. Let's go back and tell Master Luke.</v>

34
00:05:53.522 --> 00:05:55.065
<v c-3po>Goodness gracious me!</v>

35
00:06:19.005 --> 00:06:21.508
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) I don't think they're going to let us in, R2.</v>

36
00:06:22.926 --> 00:06:24.845
<v c-3po>We'd better go.</v>

37
00:06:33.645 --> 00:06:35.021
<v c-3po>R2, wait!</v>

38
00:06:37.315 --> 00:06:39.151
<v c-3po>Oh, dear! R2!</v>

39
00:06:39.651 --> 00:06:42.779
<v c-3po>R2, I really don't think we should rush into all this.</v>

40
00:06:44.364 --> 00:06:45.907
<v c-3po>R2!</v>

41
00:06:45.949 --> 00:06:47.576
<v c-3po>R2, wait for me!</v>

42
00:06:54.833 --> 00:06:59.171
<v c-3po>Just you deliver Master Luke's message and get us out of here. Oh, my!</v>

43
00:07:04.259 --> 00:07:05.760
<v c-3po>Oh, no.</v>

44
00:07:10.682 --> 00:07:11.892
<v c-3po>Oh, my!</v>

45
00:07:16.354 --> 00:07:19.566
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) We bring a message to your master Jabba the Hutt.</v>

46
00:07:23.528 --> 00:07:25.655
<v c-3po>And a gift.</v>

47
00:07:25.947 --> 00:07:27.199
<v c-3po>Gift? What gift?</v>

48
00:07:43.965 --> 00:07:48.887
<v c-3po>He says that our instructions are to give it only to Jabba himself.</v>

49
00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:00.273
<v c-3po>I'm terribly sorry.</v>

50
00:08:00.315 --> 00:08:03.360
<v c-3po>I'm afraid he's ever so stubborn about these sort of things.</v>

51
00:08:05.237 --> 00:08:08.198
<v c-3po>R2, I have a bad feeling about this.</v>

52
00:08:43.024 --> 00:08:44.609
<v c-3po>Good morning.</v>

53
00:08:50.282 --> 00:08:52.575
<v c-3po>The message, R2, the message.</v>

54
00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.170
<v luke>Greetings, Exalted One.</v>

55
00:09:04.588 --> 00:09:06.631
<v luke>Allow me to introduce myself.</v>

56
00:09:06.923 --> 00:09:10.677
<v luke>I am Luke Skywalker, Jedi knight and friend to Captain Solo.</v>

57
00:09:11.428 --> 00:09:13.930
<v luke>I know that you are powerful, mighty Jabba,</v>

58
00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.684
<v luke>and that your anger with Solo must be equally powerful.</v>

59
00:09:18.351 --> 00:09:20.020
<v luke>I seek an audience with Your Greatness</v>

60
00:09:20.061 --> 00:09:21.730
<v luke>to bargain for Solo's life.</v>

61
00:09:25.692 --> 00:09:28.528
<v luke>With your wisdom, I'm sure that we can work out an arrangement</v>

62
00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.113
<v luke>which will be mutually beneficial</v>

63
00:09:30.155 --> 00:09:34.826
<v luke>and enable us to avoid any unpleasant confrontation.</v>

64
00:09:34.868 --> 00:09:38.079
<v luke>As a token of my goodwill, I present to you a gift,</v>

65
00:09:38.622 --> 00:09:40.123
<v luke>these two droids.</v>

66
00:09:40.373 --> 00:09:42.000
<v c-3po>What did he say?</v>

67
00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.295
<v luke>Both are hardworking and will serve you well.</v>

68
00:09:45.962 --> 00:09:47.213
<v c-3po>This can't be!</v>

69
00:09:47.255 --> 00:09:49.591
<v c-3po>R2, you're playing the wrong message.</v>

70
00:09:56.306 --> 00:09:58.224
<v bib-fortuna>(IN ENGLISH) He's no Jedi.</v>

71
00:10:04.773 --> 00:10:06.858
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) We're doomed.</v>

72
00:10:21.498 --> 00:10:22.767
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) R2, look, Captain Solo.</v>

73
00:10:22.791 --> 00:10:25.377
<v c-3po>And he's still frozen in carbonite.</v>

74
00:10:38.431 --> 00:10:40.725
<v c-3po>What could possibly have come over Master Luke?</v>

75
00:10:41.893 --> 00:10:42.977
<v c-3po>Was it something I did?</v>

76
00:10:43.228 --> 00:10:45.897
<v c-3po>He never expressed any unhappiness with my work.</v>

77
00:10:45.939 --> 00:10:47.690
<v c-3po>Oh. Oh. How horrid!</v>

78
00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:19.556
<v ev-9d9>Good. New acquisitions.</v>

79
00:11:19.806 --> 00:11:22.600
<v ev-9d9>You are a protocol droid, are you not?</v>

80
00:11:22.851 --> 00:11:24.477
<v c-3po>I am C-3PO...</v>

81
00:11:24.519 --> 00:11:26.980
<v ev-9d9>Yes or no will do.</v>

82
00:11:27.021 --> 00:11:28.106
<v c-3po>Well, yes.</v>

83
00:11:28.148 --> 00:11:30.733
<v ev-9d9>How many languages do you speak?</v>

84
00:11:30.775 --> 00:11:35.447
<v c-3po>I am fluent in over six million forms of communication and can...</v>

85
00:11:35.488 --> 00:11:37.449
<v ev-9d9>Splendid. We have been without an interpreter</v>

86
00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:42.287
<v ev-9d9>since our master got angry with our last protocol droid and disintegrated him.</v>

87
00:11:42.996 --> 00:11:44.205
<v c-3po>Disintegrated?</v>

88
00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:53.047
<v ev-9d9>Guard! This protocol droid might be useful.</v>

89
00:11:53.089 --> 00:11:55.341
<v ev-9d9>Fit him with a restraining bolt</v>

90
00:11:55.383 --> 00:11:58.803
<v ev-9d9>and take him back up to His Excellency's main audience chamber.</v>

91
00:11:59.262 --> 00:12:02.265
<v c-3po>R2, don't leave me! (WHIMPERS)</v>

92
00:12:06.478 --> 00:12:08.521
<v ev-9d9>You're a feisty little one,</v>

93
00:12:08.563 --> 00:12:10.857
<v ev-9d9>but you'll soon learn some respect.</v>

94
00:12:11.316 --> 00:12:14.736
<v ev-9d9>I have need for you on the master's sail barge,</v>

95
00:12:14.777 --> 00:12:17.363
<v ev-9d9>and I think you'll fill in nicely.</v>

96
00:12:19.491 --> 00:12:21.326
<v role-droid>(SCREAMS) No! No! No!</v>

97
00:14:48.014 --> 00:14:50.391
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) No. Chewbacca!</v>

98
00:15:03.655 --> 00:15:07.075
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Yes, I am here, Your Worshipfulness.</v>

99
00:15:07.325 --> 00:15:08.368
<v c-3po>Yes?</v>

100
00:15:18.086 --> 00:15:19.837
<v c-3po>The illustrious Jabba bids you welcome</v>

101
00:15:20.088 --> 00:15:21.848
<v c-3po>and will gladly pay you the reward of 25,000.</v>

102
00:15:26.636 --> 00:15:29.013
<v boushh>(IN ENGLISH) 50,000. No less.</v>

103
00:15:41.901 --> 00:15:43.277
<v c-3po>What... What did I say?</v>

104
00:15:49.117 --> 00:15:52.245
<v c-3po>The mighty Jabba asks why he must pay 50,000.</v>

105
00:15:56.416 --> 00:15:58.584
<v c-3po>Because he's holding a thermal detonator!</v>

106
00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.366
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Jabba offers the sum of 35</v>

107
00:16:30.616 --> 00:16:32.618
<v c-3po>and I do suggest you take it.</v>

108
00:16:38.541 --> 00:16:40.084
<v c-3po>He agrees!</v>

109
00:19:29.754 --> 00:19:32.089
<v boushh>(IN ENGLISH) Just relax for a moment.</v>

110
00:19:32.715 --> 00:19:35.009
<v boushh>You're free of the carbonite.</v>

111
00:19:37.261 --> 00:19:40.556
<v boushh>You have hibernation sickness.</v>

112
00:19:40.806 --> 00:19:41.849
<v han>I can't see.</v>

113
00:19:41.933 --> 00:19:45.269
<v boushh>Your eyesight will return in time.</v>

114
00:19:45.519 --> 00:19:46.854
<v han>Where am I?</v>

115
00:19:47.104 --> 00:19:48.606
<v boushh>Jabba's palace.</v>

116
00:19:51.692 --> 00:19:52.777
<v han>Who are you?</v>

117
00:19:58.449 --> 00:19:59.825
<v leia>Someone who loves you.</v>

118
00:20:00.159 --> 00:20:01.202
<v han>Leia.</v>

119
00:20:04.622 --> 00:20:06.791
<v leia>I got to get you out of here.</v>

120
00:20:09.335 --> 00:20:10.378
<v han>What's that?</v>

121
00:20:13.673 --> 00:20:15.424
<v han>I know that laugh.</v>

122
00:20:21.472 --> 00:20:22.723
<v han>Hey, Jabba...</v>

123
00:20:22.974 --> 00:20:24.308
<v han>Look, Jabba,</v>

124
00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:27.728
<v han>I was just on my way to pay you back, and I got a little sidetracked.</v>

125
00:20:27.853 --> 00:20:28.896
<v han>It's not my fault.</v>

126
00:20:46.122 --> 00:20:47.540
<v han>(IN ENGLISH) Look...</v>

127
00:20:50.376 --> 00:20:51.976
<v han>(IN ENGLISH) Jabba, I'll pay you triple.</v>

128
00:20:52.044 --> 00:20:55.715
<v han>You're throwing away a fortune! Don't be a fool!</v>

129
00:21:03.806 --> 00:21:06.017
<v leia>(IN ENGLISH) We have powerful friends.</v>

130
00:21:06.058 --> 00:21:08.185
<v leia>You're going to regret this.</v>

131
00:21:16.485 --> 00:21:17.903
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) I can't bear to watch.</v>

132
00:21:32.251 --> 00:21:34.170
<v han>Chewie?</v>

133
00:21:35.588 --> 00:21:37.423
<v han>Chewie, is that you?</v>

134
00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.508
<v han>Chewie!</v>

135
00:21:40.885 --> 00:21:42.303
<v han>I can't see, pal.</v>

136
00:21:43.471 --> 00:21:44.930
<v han>What's going on?</v>

137
00:21:47.808 --> 00:21:49.435
<v han>Luke? Luke's crazy.</v>

138
00:21:49.477 --> 00:21:52.938
<v han>He can't even take care of himself, much less rescue anybody.</v>

139
00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.526
<v han>A Jedi knight?</v>

140
00:21:57.568 --> 00:22:01.238
<v han>I'm out of it for a little while, everybody gets delusions of grandeur.</v>

141
00:22:05.076 --> 00:22:06.952
<v han>I'm all right, pal.</v>

142
00:22:08.537 --> 00:22:09.997
<v han>I'm all right.</v>

143
00:23:04.135 --> 00:23:06.303
<v luke>I must speak with Jabba.</v>

144
00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:13.352
(IN ENGLISH) No bargain.

145
00:23:13.602 --> 00:23:15.896
<v luke>You will take me to Jabba now.</v>

146
00:23:20.317 --> 00:23:22.278
<v luke>You serve your master well.</v>

147
00:23:24.155 --> 00:23:25.990
<v luke>And you will be rewarded.</v>

148
00:23:35.124 --> 00:23:38.335
<v c-3po>At last! Master Luke's come to rescue me.</v>

149
00:23:38.586 --> 00:23:39.712
<v bib-fortuna>Master.</v>

150
00:23:49.638 --> 00:23:51.348
<v luke>(IN ENGLISH) I must be allowed to speak.</v>

151
00:24:04.528 --> 00:24:07.907
<v luke>(IN ENGLISH) You will bring Captain Solo and the Wookiee to me.</v>

152
00:24:19.335 --> 00:24:24.173
<v luke>(IN ENGLISH) Nevertheless, I'm taking Captain Solo and his friends.</v>

153
00:24:24.715 --> 00:24:28.385
<v luke>You can either profit by this or be destroyed.</v>

154
00:24:28.427 --> 00:24:31.513
<v luke>It's your choice, but I warn you not to underestimate my powers.</v>

155
00:24:33.682 --> 00:24:35.851
<v c-3po>Master Luke, you're standing on...</v>

156
00:25:16.559 --> 00:25:18.435
<v c-3po>Oh, no! The rancor!</v>

157
00:28:29.251 --> 00:28:30.502
<v luke>Han!</v>

158
00:28:30.961 --> 00:28:32.212
<v han>Luke!</v>

159
00:28:33.547 --> 00:28:34.673
<v luke>Are you all right?</v>

160
00:28:34.715 --> 00:28:36.675
<v han>Fine. Together again, huh?</v>

161
00:28:36.717 --> 00:28:38.218
<v luke>Wouldn't miss it.</v>

162
00:28:38.260 --> 00:28:39.386
<v han>How are we doing?</v>

163
00:28:39.428 --> 00:28:40.471
<v luke>Same as always.</v>

164
00:28:40.512 --> 00:28:41.930
<v han>That bad, huh?</v>

165
00:28:42.639 --> 00:28:43.724
<v han>Where's Leia?</v>

166
00:28:43.766 --> 00:28:44.933
<v leia>I'm here.</v>

167
00:28:48.312 --> 00:28:50.439
<v c-3po>Oh, dear.</v>

168
00:28:50.939 --> 00:28:53.984
<v c-3po>His High Exaltedness, the great Jabba the Hutt,</v>

169
00:28:54.026 --> 00:28:57.362
<v c-3po>has decreed that you are to be terminated immediately.</v>

170
00:28:57.404 --> 00:28:58.947
<v han>Good. I hate long waits.</v>

171
00:29:01.325 --> 00:29:03.952
<v c-3po>You will therefore be taken to the Dune Sea</v>

172
00:29:03.994 --> 00:29:06.413
<v c-3po>and cast into the Pit of Carkoon,</v>

173
00:29:06.455 --> 00:29:08.624
<v c-3po>the nesting place of the all-powerful Sarlacc.</v>

174
00:29:08.665 --> 00:29:10.209
<v han>Doesn't sound so bad.</v>

175
00:29:10.250 --> 00:29:14.129
<v c-3po>In his belly, you will find a new definition of pain and suffering,</v>

176
00:29:14.171 --> 00:29:17.341
<v c-3po>as you are slowly digested over 1,000 years.</v>

177
00:29:18.801 --> 00:29:21.303
<v han>On second thought, let's pass on that, huh?</v>

178
00:29:21.345 --> 00:29:22.721
<v luke>You should have bargained.</v>

179
00:29:26.391 --> 00:29:29.019
<v luke>That's the last mistake you'll ever make.</v>

180
00:30:20.195 --> 00:30:22.364
<v han>I think my eyes are getting better.</v>

181
00:30:22.406 --> 00:30:25.492
<v han>Instead of a big dark blur, I see a big light blur.</v>

182
00:30:26.451 --> 00:30:27.911
<v luke>There's nothing to see.</v>

183
00:30:27.953 --> 00:30:29.413
<v luke>I used to live here, you know.</v>

184
00:30:29.454 --> 00:30:31.373
<v han>You're going to die here, you know.</v>

185
00:30:31.415 --> 00:30:32.541
<v han>Convenient.</v>

186
00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.918
<v luke>Just stick close to Chewie and Lando.</v>

187
00:30:35.586 --> 00:30:37.129
<v luke>I've taken care of everything.</v>

188
00:30:37.170 --> 00:30:38.297
<v han>Oh.</v>

189
00:30:38.422 --> 00:30:39.631
<v han>Great.</v>

190
00:30:41.174 --> 00:30:42.217
<v leia>Ow.</v>

191
00:30:51.935 --> 00:30:53.371
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) I'm terribly sorry.</v>

192
00:30:53.395 --> 00:30:56.398
<v c-3po>R2, what are you doing here?</v>

193
00:30:56.440 --> 00:30:59.359
<v c-3po>Well, I can see you're serving drinks, but this place is dangerous.</v>

194
00:30:59.401 --> 00:31:02.404
<v c-3po>They're going to execute Master Luke and, if we're not careful, us, too.</v>

195
00:31:05.449 --> 00:31:07.367
<v c-3po>I wish I had your confidence.</v>

196
00:31:30.641 --> 00:31:33.226
<v c-3po>Victims of the almighty Sarlacc,</v>

197
00:31:33.268 --> 00:31:36.188
<v c-3po>His Excellency hopes that you will die honorably.</v>

198
00:31:37.898 --> 00:31:40.567
<v c-3po>But should any of you wish to beg for mercy,</v>

199
00:31:40.609 --> 00:31:44.196
<v c-3po>the great Jabba the Hutt will now listen to your pleas.</v>

200
00:31:48.992 --> 00:31:54.331
<v han>3PO, you tell that slimy piece of worm-ridden filth</v>

201
00:31:54.623 --> 00:31:57.918
<v han>he'll get no such pleasure from us! Right?</v>

202
00:32:00.754 --> 00:32:02.130
<v luke>Jabba,</v>

203
00:32:02.464 --> 00:32:04.091
<v luke>this is your last chance.</v>

204
00:32:04.841 --> 00:32:06.593
<v luke>Free us or die.</v>

205
00:33:05.027 --> 00:33:06.194
<v luke>Easy, Chewie.</v>

206
00:33:16.204 --> 00:33:17.581
<v lando>Help!</v>

207
00:33:24.254 --> 00:33:26.506
<v han>Chewie, you're hit? Where is it?</v>

208
00:33:32.429 --> 00:33:34.097
<v lando>Han! Chewie!</v>

209
00:33:34.139 --> 00:33:35.265
<v han>Lando!</v>

210
00:33:43.482 --> 00:33:44.691
<v han>Boba Fett?</v>

211
00:33:46.276 --> 00:33:48.236
<v han>Boba Fett? Where?</v>

212
00:34:22.020 --> 00:34:23.814
<v han>Lando, grab it!</v>
<v lando>Lower it!</v>

213
00:34:23.855 --> 00:34:24.898
<v han>I'm trying!</v>

214
00:34:47.129 --> 00:34:49.769
<v han>Grab me, Chewie. Come on, grab it. LANDO: I'm slipping! Quick!</v>

215
00:35:02.060 --> 00:35:04.396
<v han>Grab it! Almost... You almost got it.</v>

216
00:35:13.864 --> 00:35:15.115
<v han>Gently, now.</v>

217
00:35:15.156 --> 00:35:17.158
<v han>All right. Easy, easy. Hold me, Chewie.</v>

218
00:35:20.412 --> 00:35:21.663
<v han>Chewie!</v>

219
00:35:28.920 --> 00:35:30.589
<v han>Chewie, give me the gun.</v>

220
00:35:30.630 --> 00:35:31.882
<v han>Don't move, Lando.</v>

221
00:35:31.923 --> 00:35:33.717
<v lando>Wait! I thought you were blind!</v>

222
00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:35.886
It's all right! I can see a lot better! Don't move!

223
00:35:35.927 --> 00:35:37.470
<v lando>A little higher! Just a little higher!</v>

224
00:35:40.849 --> 00:35:42.434
<v han>Chewie, pull us up.</v>

225
00:35:43.935 --> 00:35:45.395
<v han>Up, Chewie. Up.</v>

226
00:35:47.397 --> 00:35:49.399
<v leia>Come on. We gotta get out of here.</v>

227
00:35:49.441 --> 00:35:51.318
<v c-3po>Not my eyes! R2, help!</v>

228
00:35:52.152 --> 00:35:53.904
Quickly, R2!

229
00:35:55.405 --> 00:35:56.656
<v c-3po>Beast!</v>

230
00:36:01.369 --> 00:36:02.996
<v luke>Get the gun!</v>

231
00:36:03.371 --> 00:36:04.539
<v luke>Point it at the deck!</v>

232
00:36:10.295 --> 00:36:11.588
<v luke>Point it at the deck!</v>

233
00:36:15.300 --> 00:36:18.678
<v c-3po>R2, where are we going? I couldn't possibly go... (SCREAMS)</v>

234
00:36:23.058 --> 00:36:24.601
<v luke>Come on!</v>

235
00:36:32.400 --> 00:36:34.236
<v luke>Let's go. And don't forget the droids.</v>

236
00:36:34.277 --> 00:36:35.487
<v lando>We're on our way.</v>

237
00:37:14.818 --> 00:37:16.319
<v luke>I'll meet you back at the fleet.</v>

238
00:37:16.361 --> 00:37:17.445
<v leia>Hurry.</v>

239
00:37:17.487 --> 00:37:19.197
<v leia>The Alliance should be assembled by now.</v>

240
00:37:19.239 --> 00:37:20.281
<v luke>I will.</v>

241
00:37:20.323 --> 00:37:22.075
<v han>Hey, Luke, thanks.</v>

242
00:37:22.117 --> 00:37:23.660
<v han>Thanks for coming after me.</v>

243
00:37:23.702 --> 00:37:25.370
<v han>Now I owe you one.</v>

244
00:37:31.084 --> 00:37:33.503
<v luke>That's right, R2. We're going to the Dagobah system.</v>

245
00:37:40.010 --> 00:37:42.137
<v luke>I have a promise to keep,</v>

246
00:37:42.178 --> 00:37:44.097
<v luke>to an old friend.</v>

247
00:38:35.315 --> 00:38:36.816
<v palpatine>Rise, my friend.</v>

248
00:38:43.656 --> 00:38:46.785
<v vader>The Death Star will be completed on schedule.</v>

249
00:38:47.327 --> 00:38:49.913
<v palpatine>You've done well, Lord Vader.</v>

250
00:38:49.954 --> 00:38:55.835
<v palpatine>And now I sense you wish to continue your search for young Skywalker.</v>

251
00:38:58.505 --> 00:38:59.923
<v vader>Yes, my master.</v>

252
00:39:00.423 --> 00:39:02.342
<v palpatine>Patience, my friend.</v>

253
00:39:03.468 --> 00:39:06.596
<v palpatine>In time, he will seek you out.</v>

254
00:39:06.638 --> 00:39:10.475
<v palpatine>And when he does, you must bring him before me.</v>

255
00:39:11.267 --> 00:39:13.561
<v palpatine>He has grown strong.</v>

256
00:39:13.603 --> 00:39:19.526
<v palpatine>Only together can we turn him to the dark side of the Force.</v>

257
00:39:19.567 --> 00:39:21.486
<v vader>As you wish.</v>

258
00:39:22.779 --> 00:39:26.783
<v palpatine>Everything is proceeding as I have foreseen.</v>

259
00:39:53.434 --> 00:39:55.061
<v yoda>That face you make...</v>

260
00:39:56.271 --> 00:39:58.690
<v yoda>Look I so old to young eyes?</v>

261
00:39:58.857 --> 00:40:00.859
<v luke>No, of course not.</v>

262
00:40:02.110 --> 00:40:03.403
<v yoda>I do.</v>

263
00:40:07.073 --> 00:40:08.616
<v yoda>Yes, I do.</v>

264
00:40:11.035 --> 00:40:12.829
<v yoda>Sick have I become.</v>

265
00:40:13.621 --> 00:40:15.457
<v yoda>Old and weak.</v>

266
00:40:20.295 --> 00:40:24.382
<v yoda>When 900 years old you reach, look as good you will not?</v>

267
00:40:30.847 --> 00:40:33.057
<v yoda>Soon will I rest.</v>

268
00:40:33.224 --> 00:40:34.767
<v yoda>Yes.</v>

269
00:40:34.934 --> 00:40:36.269
<v yoda>Forever sleep.</v>

270
00:40:38.188 --> 00:40:39.856
<v yoda>Earned it I have.</v>

271
00:40:40.190 --> 00:40:42.650
<v luke>Master Yoda, you can't die.</v>

272
00:40:43.902 --> 00:40:48.031
<v yoda>Strong am I with the Force, but not that strong.</v>

273
00:40:51.534 --> 00:40:56.331
<v yoda>Twilight is upon me, and soon night must fall.</v>

274
00:41:00.627 --> 00:41:02.504
<v yoda>That is the way of things...</v>

275
00:41:04.714 --> 00:41:06.841
<v yoda>The way of the Force.</v>

276
00:41:08.843 --> 00:41:10.595
<v luke>But I need your help.</v>

277
00:41:10.762 --> 00:41:13.681
<v luke>I've come back to complete the training.</v>

278
00:41:13.848 --> 00:41:16.017
<v yoda>No more training do you require.</v>

279
00:41:16.184 --> 00:41:19.145
<v yoda>Already know you that which you need.</v>

280
00:41:22.857 --> 00:41:24.734
<v luke>Then I am a Jedi.</v>

281
00:41:31.533 --> 00:41:32.784
<v yoda>Not yet.</v>

282
00:41:33.201 --> 00:41:34.827
<v yoda>One thing remains...</v>

283
00:41:36.204 --> 00:41:37.830
<v yoda>Vader.</v>

284
00:41:37.997 --> 00:41:41.459
<v yoda>You must confront Vader.</v>

285
00:41:41.501 --> 00:41:45.213
<v yoda>Then, only then, a Jedi will you be.</v>

286
00:41:47.632 --> 00:41:49.884
<v yoda>And confront him you will.</v>

287
00:41:54.264 --> 00:41:56.057
<v luke>Master Yoda,</v>

288
00:41:59.435 --> 00:42:01.646
<v luke>is Darth Vader my father?</v>

289
00:42:05.066 --> 00:42:06.693
<v yoda>Rest I need.</v>

290
00:42:07.610 --> 00:42:08.945
<v yoda>Yes.</v>

291
00:42:09.279 --> 00:42:10.488
<v yoda>Rest.</v>

292
00:42:12.615 --> 00:42:14.242
<v luke>Yoda, I must know.</v>

293
00:42:18.913 --> 00:42:20.498
<v yoda>Your father he is.</v>

294
00:42:27.338 --> 00:42:29.340
<v yoda>Told you, did he?</v>

295
00:42:31.718 --> 00:42:33.303
<v luke>Yes.</v>

296
00:42:34.846 --> 00:42:36.723
<v yoda>Unexpected this is.</v>

297
00:42:39.475 --> 00:42:40.852
<v yoda>And unfortunate.</v>

298
00:42:42.353 --> 00:42:44.689
<v luke>Unfortunate that I know the truth?</v>

299
00:42:44.856 --> 00:42:46.190
<v yoda>No.</v>

300
00:42:49.027 --> 00:42:52.447
<v yoda>Unfortunate that you rushed to face him,</v>

301
00:42:53.156 --> 00:42:55.658
<v yoda>that incomplete was your training,</v>

302
00:42:56.784 --> 00:43:00.413
<v yoda>that not ready for the burden were you.</v>

303
00:43:02.206 --> 00:43:03.583
<v luke>I'm sorry.</v>

304
00:43:05.084 --> 00:43:06.669
<v yoda>Remember,</v>

305
00:43:06.711 --> 00:43:10.465
<v yoda>a Jedi's strength flows from the Force.</v>

306
00:43:15.762 --> 00:43:17.597
<v yoda>But beware...</v>

307
00:43:17.764 --> 00:43:20.600
<v yoda>Anger, fear, aggression,</v>

308
00:43:21.184 --> 00:43:23.436
<v yoda>the dark side are they.</v>

309
00:43:24.520 --> 00:43:27.482
<v yoda>Once you start down the dark path,</v>

310
00:43:28.649 --> 00:43:31.611
<v yoda>forever will it dominate your destiny.</v>

311
00:43:34.947 --> 00:43:36.658
<v yoda>Luke...</v>

312
00:43:37.492 --> 00:43:39.077
<v yoda>Luke,</v>

313
00:43:39.494 --> 00:43:41.204
<v yoda>do not...</v>

314
00:43:44.290 --> 00:43:49.003
<v yoda>Do not underestimate the powers of the Emperor,</v>

315
00:43:50.129 --> 00:43:53.049
<v yoda>or suffer your father's fate you will.</v>

316
00:43:56.427 --> 00:43:57.678
<v yoda>Luke,</v>

317
00:43:57.845 --> 00:43:59.514
<v yoda>when gone am I,</v>

318
00:44:00.765 --> 00:44:03.768
<v yoda>the last of the Jedi will you be.</v>

319
00:44:05.144 --> 00:44:06.270
<v yoda>Luke,</v>

320
00:44:08.272 --> 00:44:12.276
<v yoda>the Force runs strong in your family.</v>

321
00:44:14.987 --> 00:44:18.616
<v yoda>Pass on what you have learned.</v>

322
00:44:21.536 --> 00:44:22.662
<v yoda>Luke...</v>

323
00:44:28.376 --> 00:44:29.877
<v yoda>there is...</v>

324
00:44:31.504 --> 00:44:33.381
<v yoda>another...</v>

325
00:44:35.299 --> 00:44:36.968
Sk...

326
00:44:37.135 --> 00:44:41.305
<v yoda>Sky... walker.</v>

327
00:45:42.408 --> 00:45:44.243
<v luke>I can't do it, R2.</v>

328
00:45:48.122 --> 00:45:50.500
<v luke>I can't go on alone.</v>

329
00:45:50.666 --> 00:45:53.753
<v obi-wan>Yoda will always be with you.</v>

330
00:45:53.920 --> 00:45:55.254
<v luke>Obi-Wan.</v>

331
00:46:03.346 --> 00:46:05.389
<v luke>Why didn't you tell me?</v>

332
00:46:05.431 --> 00:46:08.935
<v luke>You told me Vader betrayed and murdered my father.</v>

333
00:46:08.976 --> 00:46:14.106
<v obi-wan>Your father was seduced by the dark side of the Force.</v>

334
00:46:14.524 --> 00:46:19.111
<v obi-wan>He ceased to be Anakin Skywalker and became Darth Vader.</v>

335
00:46:19.195 --> 00:46:23.449
<v obi-wan>When that happened, the good man who was your father was destroyed.</v>

336
00:46:24.700 --> 00:46:27.036
<v obi-wan>So what I told you was true,</v>

337
00:46:27.078 --> 00:46:28.913
<v obi-wan>from a certain point of view.</v>

338
00:46:29.330 --> 00:46:31.541
<v luke>A certain point of view?</v>

339
00:46:31.707 --> 00:46:35.336
<v obi-wan>Luke, you're going to find that many of the truths we cling to</v>

340
00:46:35.378 --> 00:46:38.589
<v obi-wan>depend greatly on our own point of view.</v>

341
00:46:39.173 --> 00:46:42.260
<v obi-wan>Anakin was a good friend.</v>

342
00:46:42.927 --> 00:46:46.764
<v obi-wan>When I first knew him, your father was already a great pilot,</v>

343
00:46:46.931 --> 00:46:50.142
<v obi-wan>but I was amazed how strongly the Force was with him.</v>

344
00:46:50.560 --> 00:46:53.813
<v obi-wan>I took it upon myself to train him as a Jedi.</v>

345
00:46:54.689 --> 00:46:58.943
<v obi-wan>I thought that I could instruct him just as well as Yoda.</v>

346
00:46:59.110 --> 00:47:00.361
<v obi-wan>I was wrong.</v>

347
00:47:00.903 --> 00:47:03.072
<v luke>There is still good in him.</v>

348
00:47:03.406 --> 00:47:05.992
<v obi-wan>He's more machine now than man,</v>

349
00:47:06.158 --> 00:47:07.827
<v obi-wan>twisted and evil.</v>

350
00:47:09.620 --> 00:47:11.872
<v luke>I can't do it, Ben.</v>

351
00:47:12.039 --> 00:47:14.083
<v obi-wan>You cannot escape your destiny.</v>

352
00:47:14.375 --> 00:47:17.461
<v obi-wan>You must face Darth Vader again.</v>

353
00:47:17.628 --> 00:47:20.089
<v luke>I can't kill my own father.</v>

354
00:47:23.301 --> 00:47:27.430
<v obi-wan>Then the Emperor has already won.</v>

355
00:47:27.597 --> 00:47:30.933
<v obi-wan>You were our only hope.</v>

356
00:47:31.100 --> 00:47:33.603
<v luke>Yoda spoke of another.</v>

357
00:47:35.313 --> 00:47:38.024
<v obi-wan>The other he spoke of is your twin sister.</v>

358
00:47:38.816 --> 00:47:40.860
<v luke>But I have no sister.</v>
<v obi-wan>Hmm.</v>

359
00:47:41.903 --> 00:47:43.779
<v obi-wan>To protect you both from the Emperor,</v>

360
00:47:43.946 --> 00:47:47.617
<v obi-wan>you were hidden from your father when you were born.</v>

361
00:47:47.783 --> 00:47:50.161
<v obi-wan>The Emperor knew, as I did,</v>

362
00:47:50.328 --> 00:47:53.914
<v obi-wan>if Anakin were to have any offspring,</v>

363
00:47:54.081 --> 00:47:56.500
<v obi-wan>they would be a threat to him.</v>

364
00:47:56.667 --> 00:48:01.923
<v obi-wan>That is the reason why your sister remains safely anonymous.</v>

365
00:48:02.465 --> 00:48:04.300
<v luke>Leia!</v>

366
00:48:04.467 --> 00:48:05.968
<v luke>Leia's my sister.</v>

367
00:48:06.135 --> 00:48:09.513
<v obi-wan>Your insight serves you well.</v>

368
00:48:09.680 --> 00:48:12.892
<v obi-wan>Bury your feelings deep down, Luke.</v>

369
00:48:13.225 --> 00:48:18.230
<v obi-wan>They do you credit, but they could be made to serve the Emperor.</v>

370
00:48:40.920 --> 00:48:43.464
<v han>Well, look at you, a general, huh?</v>

371
00:48:43.506 --> 00:48:44.882
<v lando>Someone must have told them</v>

372
00:48:44.924 --> 00:48:46.968
<v lando>about my little maneuver at the Battle of Tanaab.</v>

373
00:48:47.301 --> 00:48:50.096
<v han>Well, don't look at me, pal. I just said you were a fair pilot.</v>

374
00:48:50.137 --> 00:48:53.057
<v han>I didn't know they were looking for somebody to lead this crazy attack.</v>

375
00:48:53.099 --> 00:48:55.893
<v lando>I'm surprised they didn't ask you to do it.</v>

376
00:48:56.060 --> 00:48:58.104
<v han>Who says they didn't? But I ain't crazy.</v>

377
00:48:58.145 --> 00:49:00.773
<v han>You're the respectable one, remember?</v>

378
00:49:08.114 --> 00:49:11.367
<v mon-mothma>The Emperor's made a critical error, and the time for our attack has come.</v>

379
00:49:12.118 --> 00:49:14.245
<v mon-mothma>The data brought to us by the Bothan spies</v>

380
00:49:14.286 --> 00:49:18.207
<v mon-mothma>pinpoint the exact location of the Emperor's new battle station.</v>

381
00:49:18.499 --> 00:49:21.085
<v mon-mothma>We also know that the weapon systems of this Death Star</v>

382
00:49:21.127 --> 00:49:22.586
<v mon-mothma>are not yet operational.</v>

383
00:49:23.003 --> 00:49:25.506
<v mon-mothma>With the Imperial fleet spread throughout the galaxy,</v>

384
00:49:25.548 --> 00:49:27.133
<v mon-mothma>in a vain effort to engage us,</v>

385
00:49:27.174 --> 00:49:29.176
<v mon-mothma>it is relatively unprotected.</v>

386
00:49:29.593 --> 00:49:32.263
<v mon-mothma>But most important of all,</v>

387
00:49:32.304 --> 00:49:35.516
<v mon-mothma>we've learned that the Emperor himself is personally overseeing</v>

388
00:49:35.558 --> 00:49:38.978
<v mon-mothma>the final stages of the construction of this Death Star.</v>

389
00:49:39.854 --> 00:49:43.774
<v mon-mothma>Many Bothans died to bring us this information.</v>

390
00:49:46.277 --> 00:49:47.737
<v mon-mothma>Admiral Ackbar, please.</v>

391
00:49:48.237 --> 00:49:53.576
<v ackbar>You can see here the Death Star orbiting the forest moon of Endor.</v>

392
00:49:53.868 --> 00:49:58.664
<v ackbar>Although the weapon systems on this Death Star are not yet operational,</v>

393
00:49:58.998 --> 00:50:02.793
<v ackbar>the Death Star does have a strong defense mechanism.</v>

394
00:50:03.961 --> 00:50:06.255
<v ackbar>It is protected by an energy shield</v>

395
00:50:06.297 --> 00:50:09.717
<v ackbar>which is generated from the nearby forest moon of Endor.</v>

396
00:50:15.222 --> 00:50:19.560
<v ackbar>The shield must be deactivated if any attack is to be attempted.</v>

397
00:50:20.770 --> 00:50:24.857
<v ackbar>Once the shield is down, our cruisers will create a perimeter</v>

398
00:50:24.899 --> 00:50:27.777
<v ackbar>while the fighters fly into the superstructure</v>

399
00:50:27.818 --> 00:50:30.738
<v ackbar>and attempt to knock out the main reactor.</v>

400
00:50:33.657 --> 00:50:37.203
<v ackbar>General Calrissian has volunteered to lead the fighter attack.</v>

401
00:50:37.244 --> 00:50:38.329
<v han>Good luck.</v>

402
00:50:40.247 --> 00:50:41.874
<v han>You're going to need it.</v>

403
00:50:41.916 --> 00:50:43.959
<v ackbar>General Madine.</v>

404
00:50:44.543 --> 00:50:47.713
<v madine>We have stolen a small Imperial shuttle.</v>

405
00:50:48.047 --> 00:50:52.051
<v madine>Disguised as a cargo ship and using a secret Imperial code,</v>

406
00:50:52.093 --> 00:50:56.931
<v madine>a strike team will land on the moon and deactivate the shield generator.</v>

407
00:50:57.181 --> 00:50:58.349
<v c-3po>Sounds dangerous.</v>

408
00:50:58.390 --> 00:51:00.726
<v leia>I wonder who they found to pull that off.</v>

409
00:51:00.768 --> 00:51:03.687
<v madine>General Solo, is your strike team assembled?</v>

410
00:51:04.480 --> 00:51:05.523
<v han>My team's ready.</v>

411
00:51:05.564 --> 00:51:07.858
<v han>I don't have a command crew for the shuttle.</v>

412
00:51:09.110 --> 00:51:11.391
<v han>It's going to be rough, pal. I didn't wanna speak for you.</v>

413
00:51:13.697 --> 00:51:14.949
<v han>That's one.</v>

414
00:51:14.990 --> 00:51:17.576
<v leia>General, count me in.</v>

415
00:51:18.035 --> 00:51:19.912
<v luke>I'm with you, too.</v>

416
00:51:25.376 --> 00:51:26.460
<v leia>What is it?</v>

417
00:51:26.502 --> 00:51:28.379
<v luke>Ask me again sometime.</v>

418
00:51:28.546 --> 00:51:29.588
<v han>Luke.</v>

419
00:51:29.630 --> 00:51:31.215
<v luke>Hi, Han, Chewie.</v>

420
00:51:33.008 --> 00:51:35.553
<v c-3po>"Exciting" is hardly the word I would choose.</v>

421
00:51:50.860 --> 00:51:54.196
<v han>Look, I want you to take her.</v>

422
00:51:54.363 --> 00:51:55.948
<v han>I mean it. Take her.</v>

423
00:51:55.990 --> 00:51:57.658
<v han>You need all the help you can get.</v>

424
00:51:57.700 --> 00:51:59.451
<v han>She's the fastest ship in the fleet.</v>

425
00:51:59.785 --> 00:52:01.787
<v lando>All right, old buddy.</v>

426
00:52:01.829 --> 00:52:04.039
<v lando>I know what she means to you.</v>

427
00:52:04.206 --> 00:52:05.875
<v lando>I'll take good care of her.</v>

428
00:52:05.916 --> 00:52:08.711
<v lando>She won't get a scratch.</v>

429
00:52:08.752 --> 00:52:10.504
<v lando>All right?</v>

430
00:52:10.546 --> 00:52:11.839
<v han>Right.</v>

431
00:52:18.637 --> 00:52:20.055
<v han>I got your promise.</v>

432
00:52:20.222 --> 00:52:21.515
<v han>Not a scratch.</v>

433
00:52:21.557 --> 00:52:23.726
<v lando>Would you get going, you pirate?</v>

434
00:52:25.728 --> 00:52:26.770
<v lando>Good luck.</v>

435
00:52:27.188 --> 00:52:28.480
<v han>You, too.</v>

436
00:52:37.573 --> 00:52:38.616
<v han>Got her warmed?</v>

437
00:52:38.699 --> 00:52:40.034
<v luke>She's coming up.</v>

438
00:52:41.911 --> 00:52:43.722
<v han>Yeah, well, I don't think the Empire had Wookiees in mind</v>

439
00:52:43.746 --> 00:52:46.498
<v han>when they designed her, Chewie.</v>

440
00:52:55.841 --> 00:52:57.635
<v leia>Hey, you awake?</v>

441
00:52:57.801 --> 00:53:01.847
<v han>Yeah. I just got a funny feeling, like I'm not gonna see her again.</v>

442
00:53:03.474 --> 00:53:05.434
<v leia>Come on, General, let's move.</v>

443
00:53:06.101 --> 00:53:09.563
<v han>Right. Chewie, let's see what this piece of junk can do.</v>

444
00:53:09.813 --> 00:53:10.856
<v han>Ready, everybody?</v>

445
00:53:10.981 --> 00:53:12.483
<v luke>All set.</v>

446
00:53:15.069 --> 00:53:16.195
<v c-3po>Here we go again.</v>

447
00:53:27.122 --> 00:53:28.791
<v han>All right, hang on.</v>

448
00:53:45.224 --> 00:53:47.935
<v vader>What is thy bidding, my master?</v>

449
00:53:48.811 --> 00:53:52.273
<v palpatine>Send the fleet to the far side of Endor.</v>

450
00:53:55.192 --> 00:53:59.446
<v palpatine>There it will stay until called for.</v>

451
00:54:01.615 --> 00:54:05.411
<v vader>What of the reports of the rebel fleet massing near Sullust?</v>

452
00:54:05.452 --> 00:54:07.496
<v palpatine>It is of no concern.</v>

453
00:54:08.038 --> 00:54:12.501
<v palpatine>Soon the rebellion will be crushed and young Skywalker will be one of us.</v>

454
00:54:12.543 --> 00:54:14.503
<v palpatine>Your work here is finished, my friend.</v>

455
00:54:14.545 --> 00:54:17.214
<v palpatine>Go out to the command ship and await my orders.</v>

456
00:54:17.256 --> 00:54:18.632
<v vader>Yes, my master.</v>

457
00:54:34.940 --> 00:54:35.983
<v han>If they don't go for this,</v>

458
00:54:36.025 --> 00:54:38.169
<v han>we're gonna have to get out of here pretty quick, Chewie.</v>

459
00:54:40.237 --> 00:54:41.756
<v role-controller>We have you on our screen now.</v>

460
00:54:41.780 --> 00:54:44.199
<v role-controller>Please identify.</v>

461
00:54:44.241 --> 00:54:48.287
<v han>Shuttle Tydirium requesting deactivation of the deflector shield.</v>

462
00:54:54.251 --> 00:54:58.005
<v role-controller>Shuttle Tydirium, transmit the clearance code for shield passage.</v>

463
00:54:59.506 --> 00:55:00.966
<v han>Transmission commencing.</v>

464
00:55:01.383 --> 00:55:03.927
<v leia>Now we find out if that code is worth the price we paid.</v>

465
00:55:04.845 --> 00:55:07.097
<v han>It'll work. It'll work.</v>

466
00:55:09.308 --> 00:55:10.893
<v luke>Vader's on that ship.</v>

467
00:55:11.143 --> 00:55:14.563
<v han>Now, don't get jittery, Luke. There are a lot of command ships.</v>

468
00:55:16.315 --> 00:55:17.542
<v han>Keep your distance, though, Chewie,</v>

469
00:55:17.566 --> 00:55:19.377
<v han>but don't look like you're trying to keep your distance.</v>

470
00:55:20.861 --> 00:55:23.572
<v han>I don't know. Fly casual.</v>

471
00:55:28.786 --> 00:55:30.662
<v vader>Where is that shuttle going?</v>

472
00:55:31.663 --> 00:55:33.874
<v piett>Shuttle Tydirium, what is your cargo and destination?</v>

473
00:55:35.793 --> 00:55:37.878
<v han>Parts and technical crew for the forest moon.</v>

474
00:55:40.339 --> 00:55:42.549
<v vader>Do they have a code clearance?</v>

475
00:55:43.133 --> 00:55:45.385
<v piett>It's an older code, sir, but it checks out.</v>

476
00:55:45.427 --> 00:55:46.887
<v piett>I was about to clear them.</v>

477
00:55:52.476 --> 00:55:55.104
I'm endangering the mission. I shouldn't have come.

478
00:55:55.145 --> 00:55:57.272
It's your imagination, kid.

479
00:55:57.314 --> 00:55:59.691
Let's keep a little optimism here.

480
00:56:08.325 --> 00:56:09.827
<v piett>Shall I hold them?</v>

481
00:56:10.452 --> 00:56:11.995
<v vader>No.</v>

482
00:56:12.037 --> 00:56:13.664
<v vader>Leave them to me.</v>

483
00:56:13.705 --> 00:56:15.916
<v vader>I will deal with them myself.</v>

484
00:56:17.042 --> 00:56:19.336
<v piett>As you wish, my lord. Carry on.</v>

485
00:56:21.088 --> 00:56:23.215
<v han>They're not going for it, Chewie.</v>

486
00:56:27.302 --> 00:56:28.929
<v role-controller>Shuttle Tydirium,</v>

487
00:56:28.971 --> 00:56:31.306
<v role-controller>deactivation of the shield will commence immediately.</v>

488
00:56:31.348 --> 00:56:32.683
<v role-controller>Follow your present course.</v>

489
00:56:34.017 --> 00:56:35.936
<v han>Okay. I told you it was going to work.</v>

490
00:56:36.812 --> 00:56:37.855
<v han>No problem.</v>

491
00:57:11.638 --> 00:57:13.348
<v c-3po>I told you it was dangerous here!</v>

492
00:57:28.864 --> 00:57:30.365
<v leia>Should we try and go around?</v>

493
00:57:30.407 --> 00:57:31.950
<v han>It'll take time.</v>

494
00:57:32.242 --> 00:57:35.162
<v han>This whole party will be for nothing if they see us.</v>

495
00:57:37.915 --> 00:57:40.542
<v han>Chewie and I will take care of this. You stay here.</v>

496
00:57:40.584 --> 00:57:43.253
<v luke>Quietly. There might be more of them out there.</v>

497
00:57:43.545 --> 00:57:45.422
<v han>Hey, it's me.</v>

498
00:58:12.115 --> 00:58:13.200
<v role-scout>Go for help! Go!</v>

499
00:58:14.201 --> 00:58:15.369
<v luke>Great. Come on!</v>

500
00:58:31.134 --> 00:58:32.803
<v leia>Over there! Two more of them.</v>

501
00:58:34.096 --> 00:58:35.973
<v luke>I see them. Wait, Leia!</v>

502
00:58:39.935 --> 00:58:41.270
<v han>Hey, wait!</v>

503
00:58:48.151 --> 00:58:50.112
<v luke>Quick. Jam their comlink! Center switch!</v>

504
00:59:01.999 --> 00:59:03.458
<v luke>Move closer!</v>

505
00:59:06.044 --> 00:59:07.879
<v luke>Get alongside that one!</v>

506
00:59:49.087 --> 00:59:51.131
<v luke>Keep on that one! I'll take these two!</v>

507
01:02:04.931 --> 01:02:06.641
<v c-3po>General Solo, somebody's coming.</v>

508
01:02:08.810 --> 01:02:09.853
<v c-3po>Oh!</v>

509
01:02:17.319 --> 01:02:18.361
<v han>Luke!</v>

510
01:02:20.197 --> 01:02:21.239
<v han>Where's Leia?</v>

511
01:02:21.990 --> 01:02:23.158
<v luke>She didn't come back?</v>

512
01:02:23.200 --> 01:02:24.493
<v han>I thought she was with you.</v>

513
01:02:24.534 --> 01:02:27.120
<v luke>We got separated. We better go look for her.</v>

514
01:02:27.162 --> 01:02:28.413
<v han>Take the squad ahead.</v>

515
01:02:28.455 --> 01:02:30.248
<v han>We'll meet at the shield generator at 0300.</v>

516
01:02:30.290 --> 01:02:32.959
<v luke>Come on, R2, we'll need your scanners.</v>

517
01:02:33.919 --> 01:02:35.021
<v c-3po>Don't worry, Master Luke.</v>

518
01:02:35.045 --> 01:02:36.463
<v c-3po>We know what to do.</v>

519
01:02:37.798 --> 01:02:40.050
<v c-3po>And you said it was pretty here.</v>

520
01:03:02.864 --> 01:03:03.990
<v leia>Cut it out!</v>

521
01:03:21.675 --> 01:03:23.593
<v leia>I'm not going to hurt you.</v>

522
01:03:31.560 --> 01:03:33.979
<v leia>Well, looks like I'm stuck here.</v>

523
01:03:36.064 --> 01:03:38.066
<v leia>Trouble is, I don't know where here is.</v>

524
01:03:39.442 --> 01:03:41.736
<v leia>Maybe you can help me.</v>

525
01:03:43.071 --> 01:03:44.531
<v leia>Come on. Sit down.</v>

526
01:03:46.491 --> 01:03:48.660
<v leia>I promise I won't hurt you. Now come here.</v>

527
01:03:50.704 --> 01:03:52.747
<v leia>All right. You want something to eat?</v>

528
01:03:59.796 --> 01:04:00.922
<v leia>That's right.</v>

529
01:04:05.719 --> 01:04:06.928
<v leia>Come on.</v>

530
01:04:27.907 --> 01:04:29.242
<v leia>Look. It's a hat.</v>

531
01:04:29.659 --> 01:04:31.578
<v leia>It's not going to hurt you. Look.</v>

532
01:04:38.084 --> 01:04:40.337
<v leia>You're a jittery little thing, aren't you?</v>

533
01:04:45.925 --> 01:04:47.260
<v leia>What is it?</v>

534
01:05:26.716 --> 01:05:27.884
<v role-scout>Freeze!</v>

535
01:05:28.426 --> 01:05:29.719
Come on, get up!

536
01:05:34.933 --> 01:05:36.533
<v role-scout>Go get your ride. Take her back to base.</v>

537
01:05:36.810 --> 01:05:37.936
<v role-scout>Yes, sir.</v>

538
01:05:42.774 --> 01:05:43.817
What the...

539
01:06:01.167 --> 01:06:03.878
<v leia>Come on. Let's get out of here.</v>

540
01:06:45.211 --> 01:06:48.465
<v palpatine>I told you to remain on the command ship.</v>

541
01:06:49.841 --> 01:06:54.429
<v vader>A small rebel force has penetrated the shield and landed on Endor.</v>

542
01:06:56.181 --> 01:06:58.058
<v palpatine>Yes, I know.</v>

543
01:06:59.476 --> 01:07:01.394
<v vader>My son is with them.</v>

544
01:07:03.313 --> 01:07:04.814
<v palpatine>Are you sure?</v>

545
01:07:04.981 --> 01:07:08.026
<v vader>I have felt him, my master.</v>

546
01:07:09.444 --> 01:07:11.696
<v palpatine>Strange that I have not.</v>

547
01:07:13.656 --> 01:07:18.161
<v palpatine>I wonder if your feelings on this matter are clear, Lord Vader.</v>

548
01:07:19.120 --> 01:07:21.706
<v vader>They are clear, my master.</v>

549
01:07:21.956 --> 01:07:26.127
<v palpatine>Then you must go to the sanctuary moon and wait for him.</v>

550
01:07:26.419 --> 01:07:28.797
<v vader>He will come to me?</v>

551
01:07:31.257 --> 01:07:33.092
<v palpatine>I have foreseen it.</v>

552
01:07:33.843 --> 01:07:37.931
<v palpatine>His compassion for you will be his undoing.</v>

553
01:07:38.097 --> 01:07:42.060
<v palpatine>He will come to you, and then you will bring him before me.</v>

554
01:07:42.894 --> 01:07:44.270
<v vader>As you wish.</v>

555
01:07:56.241 --> 01:07:57.951
<v han>Luke! Luke!</v>

556
01:08:05.291 --> 01:08:07.418
<v c-3po>Oh, Master Luke.</v>

557
01:08:11.214 --> 01:08:13.299
<v luke>There's two more wrecked speeders back there.</v>

558
01:08:13.967 --> 01:08:15.343
<v luke>And I found this.</v>

559
01:08:17.137 --> 01:08:21.391
<v c-3po>I'm afraid that R2's sensors can find no trace of Princess Leia.</v>

560
01:08:24.102 --> 01:08:25.854
<v han>I hope she's all right.</v>

561
01:08:30.650 --> 01:08:31.776
<v han>What, Chewie?</v>

562
01:08:34.320 --> 01:08:35.655
<v han>What, Chewie?</v>

563
01:08:49.878 --> 01:08:51.629
<v han>I don't get it.</v>

564
01:08:51.671 --> 01:08:53.423
<v han>It's just a dead animal, Chewie.</v>

565
01:08:54.174 --> 01:08:55.425
<v luke>Chewie, wait! Don't!</v>

566
01:09:00.805 --> 01:09:02.390
<v han>Nice work.</v>

567
01:09:04.058 --> 01:09:05.310
<v han>Great, Chewie.</v>

568
01:09:05.935 --> 01:09:07.812
<v han>Great. Always thinking with your stomach.</v>

569
01:09:07.979 --> 01:09:11.232
<v luke>Take it easy. Let's just figure a way to get out of this thing.</v>

570
01:09:11.274 --> 01:09:13.026
<v luke>Han, can you reach my lightsaber?</v>

571
01:09:13.067 --> 01:09:14.736
<v han>Yeah. Sure.</v>

572
01:09:21.618 --> 01:09:24.329
<v c-3po>R2, I'm not sure that's such a good idea.</v>

573
01:09:24.370 --> 01:09:26.122
<v c-3po>It's a very long drop!</v>

574
01:10:03.785 --> 01:10:04.953
What...

575
01:10:09.290 --> 01:10:12.251
<v han>Hey! Point that thing someplace else.</v>

576
01:10:16.631 --> 01:10:17.799
<v han>Hey!</v>

577
01:10:17.840 --> 01:10:19.842
<v luke>Han, don't. It'll be all right.</v>

578
01:10:26.724 --> 01:10:28.810
<v luke>Chewie, give them your crossbow.</v>

579
01:10:31.854 --> 01:10:33.398
<v c-3po>My head!</v>

580
01:10:37.193 --> 01:10:38.569
<v c-3po>Oh, my goodness.</v>

581
01:11:10.685 --> 01:11:12.729
<v luke>Do you understand anything they're saying?</v>

582
01:11:12.770 --> 01:11:14.063
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Yes, Master Luke.</v>

583
01:11:14.105 --> 01:11:17.191
<v c-3po>Remember that I am fluent in over six million forms...</v>

584
01:11:17.233 --> 01:11:18.860
<v han>What are you telling them?</v>

585
01:11:20.028 --> 01:11:21.279
<v c-3po>Hello, I think.</v>

586
01:11:22.280 --> 01:11:23.531
<v c-3po>I could be mistaken.</v>

587
01:11:23.573 --> 01:11:25.050
<v c-3po>They're using a very primitive dialect.</v>

588
01:11:25.074 --> 01:11:28.327
<v c-3po>But I do believe they think I am some sort of god.</v>

589
01:11:33.291 --> 01:11:37.587
<v han>Why don't you use your divine influence and get us out of this?</v>

590
01:11:37.962 --> 01:11:40.923
<v c-3po>I beg your pardon, General Solo, but that just wouldn't be proper.</v>

591
01:11:41.674 --> 01:11:42.925
<v han>Proper?</v>

592
01:11:43.092 --> 01:11:46.346
<v c-3po>It's against my programming to impersonate a deity.</v>

593
01:11:46.387 --> 01:11:47.430
<v han>Why, you...</v>

594
01:11:55.772 --> 01:11:57.065
<v han>My mistake.</v>

595
01:11:58.649 --> 01:11:59.984
<v han>He's an old friend of mine.</v>

596
01:12:27.512 --> 01:12:28.638
Hey!

597
01:12:46.364 --> 01:12:48.449
<v han>I have a really bad feeling about this.</v>

598
01:13:09.720 --> 01:13:11.389
<v han>What did he say?</v>

599
01:13:11.556 --> 01:13:13.766
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) I'm rather embarrassed, General Solo,</v>

600
01:13:13.808 --> 01:13:17.645
<v c-3po>but it appears you are to be the main course at a banquet in my honor.</v>

601
01:13:29.657 --> 01:13:31.826
Leia!

602
01:13:35.163 --> 01:13:37.540
<v c-3po>Your Royal Highness.</v>

603
01:13:37.707 --> 01:13:39.459
<v leia>But these are my friends.</v>

604
01:13:42.712 --> 01:13:45.798
<v leia>3PO, tell them they must be set free.</v>

605
01:14:04.192 --> 01:14:07.695
<v han>Somehow I got the feeling that didn't help us very much.</v>

606
01:14:07.737 --> 01:14:11.782
<v luke>3PO, tell them if they don't do as you wish,</v>

607
01:14:11.824 --> 01:14:13.826
<v luke>you'll become angry and use your magic.</v>

608
01:14:13.868 --> 01:14:16.346
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) But, Master Luke, what magic? I couldn't possibly.</v>

609
01:14:16.370 --> 01:14:17.622
<v luke>Just tell them.</v>

610
01:14:33.888 --> 01:14:34.948
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) You see, Master Luke?</v>

611
01:14:34.972 --> 01:14:37.725
<v c-3po>They didn't believe me, just as I said they wouldn't.</v>

612
01:14:37.767 --> 01:14:39.477
Wait, wait.

613
01:14:54.992 --> 01:14:56.035
<v c-3po>Put me down!</v>

614
01:14:56.077 --> 01:14:57.745
Help! Somebody!

615
01:14:58.621 --> 01:14:59.914
<v c-3po>Somebody, help!</v>

616
01:14:59.956 --> 01:15:02.333
<v c-3po>Master Luke! R2, R2, quickly!</v>

617
01:15:34.574 --> 01:15:35.866
<v c-3po>Thank goodness.</v>

618
01:15:48.588 --> 01:15:49.880
Thanks, 3PO.

619
01:15:49.922 --> 01:15:52.425
<v c-3po>I never knew I had it in me.</v>

620
01:16:25.291 --> 01:16:27.144
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Yes, R2, I was just coming to that.</v>

621
01:16:46.896 --> 01:16:48.064
Han Solo.

622
01:17:16.133 --> 01:17:17.385
<v han>What's going on?</v>

623
01:17:17.927 --> 01:17:18.969
<v leia>I don't know.</v>

624
01:17:32.650 --> 01:17:35.361
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Wonderful. We are now a part of the tribe.</v>

625
01:17:37.029 --> 01:17:38.739
<v han>Just what I always wanted.</v>

626
01:17:50.418 --> 01:17:52.503
<v han>Short help's better than no help at all.</v>

627
01:17:58.342 --> 01:17:59.945
<v c-3po>He says the scouts are going to show us</v>

628
01:17:59.969 --> 01:18:01.530
<v c-3po>the quickest way to the shield generator.</v>

629
01:18:01.554 --> 01:18:04.557
<v han>Good. How far is it? Ask him.</v>

630
01:18:06.475 --> 01:18:08.394
<v han>We need some fresh supplies, too.</v>

631
01:18:09.520 --> 01:18:10.813
<v han>Try and get our weapons back.</v>

632
01:18:12.148 --> 01:18:14.233
<v han>Hurry up, will you? I haven't got all day.</v>

633
01:18:17.027 --> 01:18:18.529
<v leia>Luke, what's wrong?</v>

634
01:18:20.740 --> 01:18:25.161
<v luke>Leia, do you remember your mother, your real mother?</v>

635
01:18:26.412 --> 01:18:29.790
<v leia>Just a little bit. She died when I was very young.</v>

636
01:18:29.957 --> 01:18:31.834
<v luke>What do you remember?</v>

637
01:18:32.126 --> 01:18:34.754
<v leia>Just images, really. Feelings.</v>

638
01:18:34.920 --> 01:18:36.172
<v luke>Tell me.</v>

639
01:18:37.214 --> 01:18:40.509
<v leia>(SIGHS) She was very beautiful.</v>

640
01:18:41.218 --> 01:18:44.013
<v leia>Kind, but sad.</v>

641
01:18:46.182 --> 01:18:48.559
<v leia>Why are you asking me this?</v>

642
01:18:49.185 --> 01:18:51.479
<v luke>I have no memory of my mother.</v>

643
01:18:52.563 --> 01:18:54.148
<v luke>I never knew her.</v>

644
01:18:55.900 --> 01:18:58.486
<v leia>Luke, tell me, what's troubling you?</v>

645
01:19:03.407 --> 01:19:04.950
<v luke>Vader is here.</v>

646
01:19:05.117 --> 01:19:06.994
<v luke>Now. On this moon.</v>

647
01:19:08.996 --> 01:19:10.664
<v leia>How do you know?</v>

648
01:19:10.831 --> 01:19:12.708
<v luke>I felt his presence.</v>

649
01:19:13.626 --> 01:19:15.002
<v luke>He's come for me.</v>

650
01:19:15.044 --> 01:19:17.004
<v luke>He can feel when I'm near.</v>

651
01:19:17.046 --> 01:19:18.923
<v luke>That's why I have to go.</v>

652
01:19:18.964 --> 01:19:23.260
<v luke>As long as I stay, I'm endangering the group and our mission here.</v>

653
01:19:23.427 --> 01:19:25.012
<v luke>I have to face him.</v>

654
01:19:25.179 --> 01:19:26.514
<v leia>Why?</v>

655
01:19:31.310 --> 01:19:33.145
<v luke>He's my father.</v>

656
01:19:37.358 --> 01:19:38.734
<v leia>Your father?</v>

657
01:19:40.319 --> 01:19:41.612
<v luke>There's more.</v>

658
01:19:41.654 --> 01:19:44.406
<v luke>It won't be easy for you to hear it, but you must.</v>

659
01:19:44.448 --> 01:19:47.451
<v luke>If I don't make it back, you're the only hope for the Alliance.</v>

660
01:19:47.493 --> 01:19:49.036
<v leia>Luke, don't talk that way.</v>

661
01:19:49.078 --> 01:19:53.249
<v leia>You have a power I don't understand and could never have.</v>

662
01:19:53.666 --> 01:19:55.334
<v luke>You're wrong, Leia.</v>

663
01:19:55.793 --> 01:19:57.753
<v luke>You have that power, too.</v>

664
01:19:57.920 --> 01:20:00.673
<v luke>In time, you'll learn to use it as I have.</v>

665
01:20:05.511 --> 01:20:07.847
<v luke>The Force is strong in my family.</v>

666
01:20:09.306 --> 01:20:11.141
<v luke>My father has it.</v>

667
01:20:12.726 --> 01:20:14.520
<v luke>I have it.</v>

668
01:20:14.687 --> 01:20:15.980
<v luke>And</v>

669
01:20:17.356 --> 01:20:19.149
<v luke>my sister has it.</v>

670
01:20:26.115 --> 01:20:27.658
<v luke>Yes.</v>

671
01:20:27.825 --> 01:20:29.660
<v luke>It's you, Leia.</v>

672
01:20:34.540 --> 01:20:35.958
<v leia>I know.</v>

673
01:20:39.044 --> 01:20:41.213
<v leia>Somehow,</v>

674
01:20:42.548 --> 01:20:44.008
<v leia>I've always known.</v>

675
01:20:44.049 --> 01:20:46.093
<v luke>Then you know why I have to face him.</v>

676
01:20:46.260 --> 01:20:50.347
<v leia>No! Luke, run away. Far away.</v>

677
01:20:50.514 --> 01:20:53.851
<v leia>If he can feel your presence, then leave this place.</v>

678
01:20:54.018 --> 01:20:55.394
<v leia>I wish I could go with you.</v>

679
01:20:55.477 --> 01:20:57.563
<v luke>No, you don't.</v>

680
01:20:57.605 --> 01:20:59.440
<v luke>You've always been strong.</v>

681
01:21:00.608 --> 01:21:02.818
<v leia>But why must you confront him?</v>

682
01:21:02.985 --> 01:21:05.362
<v luke>Because there is good in him.</v>

683
01:21:05.404 --> 01:21:06.697
<v luke>I've felt it.</v>

684
01:21:07.197 --> 01:21:08.949
<v luke>He won't turn me over to the Emperor.</v>

685
01:21:08.991 --> 01:21:12.202
<v luke>I can save him. I can turn him back to the good side.</v>

686
01:21:13.621 --> 01:21:14.872
<v luke>I have to try.</v>

687
01:21:34.016 --> 01:21:35.976
<v han>Hey, what's going on?</v>

688
01:21:37.353 --> 01:21:38.395
<v leia>Nothing.</v>

689
01:21:38.479 --> 01:21:41.649
<v leia>I just want to be alone for a little while.</v>

690
01:21:42.316 --> 01:21:44.193
<v han>Nothing?</v>

691
01:21:45.819 --> 01:21:47.780
<v han>Come on, tell me. What's going on?</v>

692
01:21:52.576 --> 01:21:53.619
<v leia>I...</v>

693
01:21:53.661 --> 01:21:55.120
<v leia>I can't tell you.</v>

694
01:21:56.664 --> 01:21:59.375
<v han>Could you tell Luke? Is that who you could tell?</v>

695
01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:01.877
<v leia>I...</v>

696
01:22:17.059 --> 01:22:18.310
<v han>I'm sorry.</v>

697
01:22:22.481 --> 01:22:23.732
<v leia>Hold me.</v>

698
01:23:17.786 --> 01:23:19.538
<v role-commander>This is the rebel that surrendered to us.</v>

699
01:23:19.872 --> 01:23:22.249
<v role-commander>Although he denies it, I believe there may be more of them,</v>

700
01:23:22.291 --> 01:23:25.210
<v role-commander>and I request permission to conduct a further search of the area.</v>

701
01:23:26.170 --> 01:23:28.130
<v role-commander>He was armed only with this.</v>

702
01:23:30.966 --> 01:23:32.885
<v vader>Good work, Commander.</v>

703
01:23:33.302 --> 01:23:34.595
<v vader>Leave us.</v>

704
01:23:34.762 --> 01:23:38.474
<v vader>Conduct your search and bring his companions to me.</v>

705
01:23:39.767 --> 01:23:41.059
<v role-commander>Yes, my lord.</v>

706
01:23:43.437 --> 01:23:45.898
<v vader>The Emperor has been expecting you.</v>

707
01:23:47.149 --> 01:23:48.734
<v luke>I know, Father.</v>

708
01:23:50.068 --> 01:23:52.529
<v vader>So, you have accepted the truth.</v>

709
01:23:53.489 --> 01:23:57.201
<v luke>I've accepted the truth that you were once Anakin Skywalker, my father.</v>

710
01:23:57.242 --> 01:24:00.412
<v vader>That name no longer has any meaning for me.</v>

711
01:24:00.996 --> 01:24:03.999
<v luke>It is the name of your true self. You've only forgotten.</v>

712
01:24:04.625 --> 01:24:06.210
<v luke>I know there is good in you.</v>

713
01:24:06.668 --> 01:24:10.089
<v luke>The Emperor hasn't driven it from you fully.</v>

714
01:24:13.008 --> 01:24:16.053
<v luke>That was why you couldn't destroy me.</v>

715
01:24:16.220 --> 01:24:19.306
<v luke>That's why you won't bring me to your Emperor now.</v>

716
01:24:26.146 --> 01:24:29.274
<v vader>I see you have constructed a new lightsaber.</v>

717
01:24:33.237 --> 01:24:35.864
<v vader>Your skills are complete.</v>

718
01:24:40.911 --> 01:24:45.332
<v vader>Indeed you are powerful, as the Emperor has foreseen.</v>

719
01:24:50.420 --> 01:24:52.422
<v luke>Come with me.</v>

720
01:24:54.258 --> 01:24:57.511
<v vader>Obi-Wan once thought as you do.</v>

721
01:24:58.637 --> 01:25:03.267
<v vader>You don't know the power of the dark side.</v>

722
01:25:03.308 --> 01:25:06.353
<v vader>I must obey my master.</v>

723
01:25:07.271 --> 01:25:10.440
<v luke>I will not turn, and you'll be forced to kill me.</v>

724
01:25:11.900 --> 01:25:14.236
<v vader>If that is your destiny.</v>

725
01:25:15.070 --> 01:25:18.574
<v luke>Search your feelings, Father. You can't do this.</v>

726
01:25:18.615 --> 01:25:21.535
<v luke>I feel the conflict within you. Let go of your hate.</v>

727
01:25:22.536 --> 01:25:25.747
<v vader>It is too late for me, son.</v>

728
01:25:29.084 --> 01:25:33.672
<v vader>The Emperor will show you the true nature of the Force.</v>

729
01:25:34.214 --> 01:25:37.092
<v vader>He is your master now.</v>

730
01:25:41.263 --> 01:25:43.265
<v luke>Then my father is truly dead.</v>

731
01:26:26.642 --> 01:26:28.203
<v leia>The main entrance to the control bunker</v>

732
01:26:28.227 --> 01:26:30.979
<v leia>is on the far side of that landing platform.</v>

733
01:26:31.647 --> 01:26:33.315
<v leia>This isn't going to be easy.</v>

734
01:26:33.482 --> 01:26:35.442
<v han>Hey, don't worry.</v>

735
01:26:35.609 --> 01:26:38.695
<v han>Chewie and me got into a lot of places more heavily guarded than this.</v>

736
01:26:47.371 --> 01:26:48.705
<v leia>What's he saying?</v>

737
01:26:48.747 --> 01:26:51.827
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) He says there's a secret entrance on the other side of the ridge.</v>

738
01:27:11.436 --> 01:27:13.146
<v lando>Admiral, we're in position.</v>

739
01:27:13.313 --> 01:27:14.731
<v lando>All fighters accounted for.</v>

740
01:27:15.357 --> 01:27:17.943
<v ackbar>Proceed with the countdown.</v>

741
01:27:18.568 --> 01:27:21.280
<v ackbar>All groups assume attack coordinates.</v>

742
01:27:24.741 --> 01:27:26.660
<v lando>Don't worry. My friend's down there.</v>

743
01:27:26.702 --> 01:27:28.829
<v lando>He'll have that shield down on time.</v>

744
01:27:31.999 --> 01:27:34.876
<v lando>Or this will be the shortest offensive of all time.</v>

745
01:27:36.420 --> 01:27:40.257
<v ackbar>All craft, prepare to jump into hyperspace on my mark.</v>

746
01:27:40.632 --> 01:27:42.050
<v lando>All right. Stand by.</v>

747
01:28:01.903 --> 01:28:03.822
<v han>Back door, huh? Good idea.</v>

748
01:28:12.414 --> 01:28:14.750
<v han>It's only a few guards. This shouldn't be too much trouble.</v>

749
01:28:20.964 --> 01:28:23.050
<v leia>It only takes one to sound the alarm.</v>

750
01:28:23.633 --> 01:28:25.677
<v han>Then we'll do it real quiet like.</v>

751
01:28:26.636 --> 01:28:28.597
<v c-3po>(IN ENGLISH) Oh, my! Princess Leia!</v>

752
01:28:29.765 --> 01:28:34.269
<v c-3po>I'm afraid our furry companion has gone and done something rather rash.</v>

753
01:28:36.271 --> 01:28:37.606
<v leia>Oh, no.</v>

754
01:28:39.232 --> 01:28:41.318
<v han>There goes our surprise attack.</v>

755
01:28:49.326 --> 01:28:51.286
<v role-scout>Look, over there! Stop him!</v>

756
01:29:03.006 --> 01:29:04.299
<v han>Not bad for a little furball.</v>

757
01:29:04.383 --> 01:29:05.675
<v han>There's only one left.</v>

758
01:29:05.967 --> 01:29:07.052
<v han>You stay here.</v>

759
01:29:07.094 --> 01:29:08.678
<v han>We'll take care of this.</v>

760
01:29:10.639 --> 01:29:13.016
<v c-3po>I have decided that we shall stay here.</v>

761
01:29:43.255 --> 01:29:44.381
<v role-scout>Hey!</v>

762
01:30:47.903 --> 01:30:50.947
<v palpatine>Welcome, young Skywalker.</v>

763
01:30:51.031 --> 01:30:54.409
<v palpatine>I have been expecting you.</v>

764
01:30:54.492 --> 01:30:56.286
<v palpatine>You'll no longer need those.</v>

765
01:31:01.833 --> 01:31:04.169
<v palpatine>Guards, leave us.</v>

766
01:31:10.926 --> 01:31:14.054
<v palpatine>I'm looking forward to completing your training.</v>

767
01:31:14.513 --> 01:31:19.226
<v palpatine>In time, you will call me master.</v>

768
01:31:19.935 --> 01:31:21.519
<v luke>You're gravely mistaken.</v>

769
01:31:22.604 --> 01:31:24.648
<v luke>You won't convert me as you did my father.</v>

770
01:31:25.106 --> 01:31:29.110
<v palpatine>No, my young Jedi.</v>

771
01:31:31.154 --> 01:31:35.325
<v palpatine>You will find that it is you who are mistaken</v>

772
01:31:36.785 --> 01:31:41.081
<v palpatine>about a great many things.</v>

773
01:31:42.499 --> 01:31:44.251
<v vader>His lightsaber.</v>

774
01:31:44.292 --> 01:31:47.462
<v palpatine>Yes. A Jedi's weapon.</v>

775
01:31:48.880 --> 01:31:51.132
<v palpatine>Much like your father's.</v>

776
01:31:51.299 --> 01:31:56.179
<v palpatine>By now you must know your father can never be turned from the dark side.</v>

777
01:31:56.346 --> 01:31:58.431
<v palpatine>So will it be with you.</v>

778
01:31:59.307 --> 01:32:01.226
<v luke>You're wrong.</v>

779
01:32:01.393 --> 01:32:04.354
<v luke>Soon I'll be dead, and you with me.</v>

780
01:32:07.857 --> 01:32:12.195
<v palpatine>Perhaps you refer to the imminent attack of your rebel fleet.</v>

781
01:32:13.154 --> 01:32:14.656
<v palpatine>Yes.</v>

782
01:32:14.698 --> 01:32:19.619
<v palpatine>I assure you, we are quite safe from your friends here.</v>

783
01:32:21.288 --> 01:32:23.623
<v luke>Your overconfidence is your weakness.</v>

784
01:32:24.082 --> 01:32:26.835
<v palpatine>Your faith in your friends is yours.</v>

785
01:32:29.504 --> 01:32:32.799
<v vader>It is pointless to resist, my son.</v>

786
01:32:37.137 --> 01:32:42.434
<v palpatine>Everything that has transpired has done so according to my design.</v>

787
01:32:42.851 --> 01:32:46.021
<v palpatine>Your friends up there on the sanctuary moon</v>

788
01:32:46.062 --> 01:32:50.150
<v palpatine>are walking into a trap, as is your rebel fleet.</v>

789
01:32:52.152 --> 01:32:54.821
<v palpatine>It was I who allowed the Alliance</v>

790
01:32:54.863 --> 01:32:57.949
<v palpatine>to know the location of the shield generator.</v>

791
01:32:58.408 --> 01:33:02.829
<v palpatine>It is quite safe from your pitiful little band.</v>

792
01:33:03.163 --> 01:33:07.167
<v palpatine>An entire legion of my best troops awaits them.</v>

793
01:33:08.376 --> 01:33:13.256
<v palpatine>Oh, I'm afraid the deflector shield</v>

794
01:33:13.298 --> 01:33:18.637
<v palpatine>will be quite operational when your friends arrive.</v>

795
01:33:22.182 --> 01:33:24.851
<v han>All right, up! Move! Come on.</v>

796
01:33:25.268 --> 01:33:26.811
<v han>Quickly. Quickly.</v>

797
01:33:27.812 --> 01:33:28.980
<v han>Chewie.</v>

798
01:33:31.274 --> 01:33:32.692
<v leia>Han, hurry!</v>

799
01:33:32.859 --> 01:33:34.986
<v leia>The fleet will be here any moment.</v>

800
01:33:36.446 --> 01:33:38.156
<v han>Charges! Come on, come on!</v>

801
01:33:41.284 --> 01:33:42.952
<v c-3po>Oh, my! They'll be captured!</v>

802
01:33:45.955 --> 01:33:47.457
<v c-3po>Wait! Wait! Come back!</v>

803
01:33:50.085 --> 01:33:51.586
<v c-3po>R2, stay with me.</v>

804
01:33:52.629 --> 01:33:53.755
<v role-commander>Freeze!</v>

805
01:33:57.592 --> 01:33:58.718
<v role-commander>You rebel scum.</v>

806
01:34:19.280 --> 01:34:20.657
<v lando>All wings report in.</v>

807
01:34:21.408 --> 01:34:22.909
<v wedge>Red Leader standing by.</v>

808
01:34:23.076 --> 01:34:24.702
<v role-pilot>Gray Leader standing by.</v>

809
01:34:24.869 --> 01:34:25.995
<v role-pilot>Green Leader standing by.</v>

810
01:34:26.746 --> 01:34:28.790
<v wedge>Lock S-foils in attack positions.</v>

811
01:34:32.877 --> 01:34:34.879
<v ackbar>May the Force be with us.</v>

812
01:34:38.842 --> 01:34:41.261
<v lando>We've got to get a reading on that shield.</v>

813
01:34:43.388 --> 01:34:46.808
<v lando>How could they be jamming us if they don't know</v>

814
01:34:46.975 --> 01:34:48.393
<v lando>if we're coming.</v>

815
01:34:48.643 --> 01:34:49.936
<v lando>Break off the attack!</v>

816
01:34:50.395 --> 01:34:52.021
<v lando>The shield is still up.</v>

817
01:34:52.522 --> 01:34:54.232
<v role-pilot>I get no reading. You sure?</v>

818
01:34:54.566 --> 01:34:56.526
<v lando>Pull up! All craft pull up!</v>

819
01:35:00.989 --> 01:35:02.282
<v ackbar>Take evasive action.</v>

820
01:35:02.323 --> 01:35:05.034
<v ackbar>Green Group, stick to Holding Sector MV-7.</v>

821
01:35:07.036 --> 01:35:09.789
<v role-controller>Admiral, we have enemy ships in Sector 47.</v>

822
01:35:10.123 --> 01:35:11.332
<v ackbar>It's a trap!</v>

823
01:35:15.086 --> 01:35:16.296
<v lando>Fighters coming in!</v>

824
01:35:20.341 --> 01:35:21.634
<v role-pilot>There's too many of them!</v>

825
01:35:25.388 --> 01:35:26.806
<v lando>Accelerate to attack speed.</v>

826
01:35:26.848 --> 01:35:28.408
<v lando>Draw their fire away from the cruisers.</v>

827
01:35:28.433 --> 01:35:29.559
<v wedge>Copy, Gold Leader.</v>

828
01:35:32.937 --> 01:35:35.106
<v palpatine>Come, boy.</v>

829
01:35:35.273 --> 01:35:37.108
<v palpatine>See for yourself.</v>

830
01:35:39.652 --> 01:35:45.200
<v palpatine>From here, you will witness the final destruction of the Alliance</v>

831
01:35:45.283 --> 01:35:48.912
<v palpatine>and the end of your insignificant rebellion.</v>

832
01:35:54.042 --> 01:35:56.794
<v palpatine>You want this,</v>

833
01:35:57.003 --> 01:35:59.380
<v palpatine>don't you?</v>

834
01:35:59.547 --> 01:36:03.426
<v palpatine>The hate is swelling in you now.</v>

835
01:36:04.511 --> 01:36:06.971
<v palpatine>Take your Jedi weapon.</v>

836
01:36:07.138 --> 01:36:08.640
<v palpatine>Use it.</v>

837
01:36:08.807 --> 01:36:10.642
<v palpatine>I am unarmed.</v>

838
01:36:10.892 --> 01:36:12.936
<v palpatine>Strike me down with it.</v>

839
01:36:13.102 --> 01:36:16.022
<v palpatine>Give in to your anger.</v>

840
01:36:16.648 --> 01:36:22.070
<v palpatine>With each passing moment, you make yourself more my servant.</v>

841
01:36:26.783 --> 01:36:28.117
<v luke>No.</v>

842
01:36:28.451 --> 01:36:30.328
<v palpatine>It is unavoidable.</v>

843
01:36:31.120 --> 01:36:33.373
<v palpatine>It is your destiny.</v>

844
01:36:34.415 --> 01:36:37.293
<v palpatine>You, like your father,</v>

845
01:36:37.961 --> 01:36:39.212
<v palpatine>are now</v>

846
01:36:40.296 --> 01:36:41.798
<v palpatine>mine.</v>

847
01:36:59.732 --> 01:37:01.943
<v role-stormtrooper>All right, move it!</v>

848
01:37:03.861 --> 01:37:06.364
Keep moving. Come on.

849
01:37:10.285 --> 01:37:12.287
<v c-3po>Hello! I say, over there!</v>

850
01:37:12.745 --> 01:37:14.163
<v c-3po>Were you looking for me?</v>

851
01:37:17.208 --> 01:37:18.751
<v role-commander>Bring those two down here.</v>

852
01:37:26.342 --> 01:37:27.635
<v c-3po>Well, they're on their way.</v>

853
01:37:27.885 --> 01:37:29.762
<v c-3po>R2, are you sure this was a good idea?</v>

854
01:37:30.471 --> 01:37:31.991
<v role-stormtrooper>Freeze!</v>

855
01:37:32.390 --> 01:37:33.433
<v role-stormtrooper>Don't move!</v>

856
01:37:33.725 --> 01:37:35.268
<v c-3po>We surrender.</v>

857
01:39:40.977 --> 01:39:44.480
<v leia>The code's changed. We need R2.</v>

858
01:39:44.647 --> 01:39:45.773
<v han>Here's the terminal.</v>

859
01:39:45.815 --> 01:39:49.527
<v leia>R2, where are you? We need you at the bunker right away.</v>

860
01:39:51.779 --> 01:39:53.779
<v c-3po>What do you mean, you're going?</v>

861
01:39:55.616 --> 01:39:57.076
<v c-3po>Going where, R2?</v>

862
01:39:57.118 --> 01:39:58.619
No, wait!

863
01:39:58.661 --> 01:40:00.913
<v c-3po>This is no time for heroics!</v>

864
01:40:01.205 --> 01:40:02.498
<v c-3po>Come back!</v>

865
01:40:28.900 --> 01:40:30.777
<v lando>Watch yourself, Wedge. Three from above.</v>

866
01:40:30.985 --> 01:40:32.403
<v wedge>Red 3, Red 2, pull in.</v>

867
01:40:32.445 --> 01:40:33.696
<v role-pilot>Got it.</v>

868
01:40:36.991 --> 01:40:38.826
<v role-pilot>Three of them coming in, 20 degrees.</v>

869
01:40:38.951 --> 01:40:40.620
<v wedge>Cut to the left. I'll take the leader.</v>

870
01:40:49.045 --> 01:40:50.645
<v wedge>They're heading for the medical frigate.</v>

871
01:40:56.260 --> 01:40:57.553
<v role-navigator>Pressure steady.</v>

872
01:41:06.270 --> 01:41:07.414
<v lando>Only the fighters are attacking.</v>

873
01:41:07.438 --> 01:41:09.478
<v lando>I wonder what those Star Destroyers are waiting for.</v>

874
01:41:13.986 --> 01:41:15.780
<v role-commander>We're in attack position, sir.</v>

875
01:41:15.822 --> 01:41:17.281
<v piett>Hold here.</v>

876
01:41:17.448 --> 01:41:19.158
<v role-commander>We're not going to attack?</v>

877
01:41:19.200 --> 01:41:20.761
<v piett>I have my orders from the Emperor himself.</v>

878
01:41:20.785 --> 01:41:22.453
<v piett>He has something special planned for them.</v>

879
01:41:22.495 --> 01:41:24.330
<v piett>We only need to keep them from escaping.</v>

880
01:41:26.124 --> 01:41:30.128
<v palpatine>As you can see, my young apprentice,</v>

881
01:41:30.336 --> 01:41:33.506
<v palpatine>your friends have failed.</v>

882
01:41:34.340 --> 01:41:36.968
<v palpatine>Now witness the firepower</v>

883
01:41:37.009 --> 01:41:42.223
<v palpatine>of this fully armed and operational battle station.</v>

884
01:41:43.599 --> 01:41:45.518
<v palpatine>Fire at will, Commander.</v>

885
01:41:52.984 --> 01:41:54.110
<v jerjerrod>Fire.</v>

886
01:42:01.742 --> 01:42:03.661
<v lando>That blast came from the Death Star.</v>

887
01:42:04.745 --> 01:42:06.956
<v lando>That thing's operational!</v>

888
01:42:07.582 --> 01:42:09.208
<v lando>Home 1, this is Gold Leader.</v>

889
01:42:09.250 --> 01:42:11.419
<v ackbar>All craft prepare to retreat.</v>

890
01:42:11.460 --> 01:42:13.754
<v lando>You won't get another chance at this, Admiral.</v>

891
01:42:13.796 --> 01:42:16.674
<v ackbar>We have no choice, General Calrissian.</v>

892
01:42:16.716 --> 01:42:20.052
<v ackbar>Our cruisers can't repel firepower of that magnitude.</v>

893
01:42:20.094 --> 01:42:21.721
<v lando>Han will have that shield down.</v>

894
01:42:21.762 --> 01:42:23.764
<v lando>We've got to give him more time.</v>

895
01:42:42.700 --> 01:42:44.035
<v c-3po>We're coming!</v>

896
01:42:49.498 --> 01:42:51.042
<v han>Come on, come on!</v>

897
01:42:55.379 --> 01:42:56.505
R2, hurry!

898
01:43:02.637 --> 01:43:03.888
<v c-3po>Oh, my goodness!</v>

899
01:43:10.186 --> 01:43:11.604
<v c-3po>Why did you have to be so brave?</v>

900
01:43:14.523 --> 01:43:17.652
<v han>Well, I suppose I could hot-wire this thing.</v>

901
01:43:17.818 --> 01:43:18.861
<v leia>I'll cover you.</v>

902
01:44:00.569 --> 01:44:01.612
<v lando>Yes, I said closer.</v>

903
01:44:01.696 --> 01:44:02.738
<v lando>Move as close as you can</v>

904
01:44:02.780 --> 01:44:05.741
<v lando>and engage those Star Destroyers at point-blank range!</v>

905
01:44:05.950 --> 01:44:09.328
<v ackbar>At that close range, we won't last long against those Star Destroyers.</v>

906
01:44:09.370 --> 01:44:12.206
<v lando>We'll last longer than we will against that Death Star!</v>

907
01:44:12.248 --> 01:44:14.250
<v lando>And we might just take a few of them with us.</v>

908
01:44:17.503 --> 01:44:18.629
<v role-pilot>She's going to blow!</v>

909
01:44:22.758 --> 01:44:23.968
<v role-pilot>I'm hit!</v>

910
01:44:29.432 --> 01:44:31.600
<v palpatine>Your fleet is lost,</v>

911
01:44:31.642 --> 01:44:35.563
<v palpatine>and your friends on the Endor moon will not survive.</v>

912
01:44:37.898 --> 01:44:40.484
<v palpatine>There is no escape,</v>

913
01:44:40.651 --> 01:44:42.945
<v palpatine>my young apprentice.</v>

914
01:44:45.239 --> 01:44:47.950
<v palpatine>The Alliance will die,</v>

915
01:44:49.910 --> 01:44:53.080
<v palpatine>as will your friends.</v>

916
01:44:56.375 --> 01:44:57.835
<v palpatine>Good.</v>

917
01:44:58.753 --> 01:45:01.881
<v palpatine>I can feel your anger.</v>

918
01:45:03.507 --> 01:45:05.051
<v palpatine>I am defenseless.</v>

919
01:45:05.718 --> 01:45:07.136
<v palpatine>Take your weapon.</v>

920
01:45:07.261 --> 01:45:10.347
<v palpatine>Strike me down with all of your hatred,</v>

921
01:45:10.389 --> 01:45:14.310
<v palpatine>and your journey towards the dark side will be complete!</v>

922
01:45:53.974 --> 01:45:55.017
<v role-pilot>Look!</v>

923
01:45:55.059 --> 01:45:56.727
<v role-pilot>Get him off of there!</v>

924
01:47:49.715 --> 01:47:51.008
<v han>I think I got it.</v>

925
01:47:51.717 --> 01:47:52.927
<v han>I got it!</v>

926
01:48:00.184 --> 01:48:01.519
<v c-3po>Princess Leia, are you all right?</v>

927
01:48:01.560 --> 01:48:03.521
<v han>Let's see.</v>
<v leia>It's not bad.</v>

928
01:48:03.562 --> 01:48:04.939
<v role-stormtrooper>Freeze!</v>
<v c-3po>Oh, dear.</v>

929
01:48:05.314 --> 01:48:07.066
<v role-stormtrooper>Don't move!</v>

930
01:48:10.444 --> 01:48:12.238
<v han>I love you.</v>

931
01:48:12.613 --> 01:48:13.864
<v leia>I know.</v>

932
01:48:14.114 --> 01:48:15.157
<v role-stormtrooper>Hands up!</v>

933
01:48:16.784 --> 01:48:17.910
<v role-stormtrooper>Stand up!</v>

934
01:48:27.586 --> 01:48:28.837
<v han>Stay back.</v>

935
01:48:34.260 --> 01:48:35.386
<v han>Chewie!</v>

936
01:48:37.096 --> 01:48:38.347
<v han>Get down here! She's wounded!</v>

937
01:48:39.515 --> 01:48:40.557
<v han>No, wait!</v>

938
01:48:41.684 --> 01:48:42.977
<v han>I got an idea.</v>

939
01:48:54.196 --> 01:48:55.698
<v palpatine>Good.</v>

940
01:48:56.365 --> 01:48:59.743
<v palpatine>Use your aggressive feelings, boy.</v>

941
01:48:59.910 --> 01:49:02.705
<v palpatine>Let the hate flow through you.</v>

942
01:49:08.127 --> 01:49:11.505
<v vader>Obi-Wan has taught you well.</v>

943
01:49:15.593 --> 01:49:17.678
<v luke>I will not fight you, Father.</v>

944
01:49:31.859 --> 01:49:35.321
<v vader>You are unwise to lower your defenses.</v>

945
01:49:59.678 --> 01:50:01.930
<v luke>Your thoughts betray you, Father.</v>

946
01:50:02.097 --> 01:50:04.892
<v luke>I feel the good in you, the conflict.</v>

947
01:50:05.351 --> 01:50:07.811
<v vader>There is no conflict.</v>

948
01:50:10.189 --> 01:50:11.989
<v luke>You couldn't bring yourself to kill me before.</v>

949
01:50:12.024 --> 01:50:14.151
<v luke>I don't believe you'll destroy me now.</v>

950
01:50:14.610 --> 01:50:18.989
<v vader>You underestimate the power of the dark side.</v>

951
01:50:19.031 --> 01:50:23.243
<v vader>If you will not fight, then you will meet your destiny.</v>

952
01:50:34.880 --> 01:50:37.633
<v palpatine>Good. Good.</v>

953
01:50:46.642 --> 01:50:48.852
<v lando>Watch out! Squad at .06.</v>

954
01:50:48.894 --> 01:50:50.145
<v role-pilot>I'm on it, Gold Leader.</v>

955
01:50:52.064 --> 01:50:53.232
<v wedge>Good shot, Red 2.</v>

956
01:50:57.111 --> 01:50:58.713
<v lando>We're sure in the middle of it now.</v>

957
01:50:58.737 --> 01:51:01.740
<v lando>Come on, Han, old buddy, don't let me down.</v>

958
01:51:06.453 --> 01:51:08.038
<v role-pilot>It's over, Commander.</v>

959
01:51:08.080 --> 01:51:10.499
<v role-pilot>The rebels have been routed. They're fleeing into the woods.</v>

960
01:51:10.541 --> 01:51:13.919
<v role-pilot>We need reinforcements to continue the pursuit.</v>

961
01:51:13.961 --> 01:51:15.629
<v role-commander>Send three squads to help.</v>

962
01:51:16.255 --> 01:51:17.756
<v role-commander>Open the back door.</v>
<v role-commander>Sir.</v>

963
01:51:32.646 --> 01:51:33.856
<v han>Throw me another charge.</v>

964
01:51:51.331 --> 01:51:53.834
<v vader>You cannot hide forever, Luke.</v>

965
01:51:55.461 --> 01:51:57.713
<v luke>I will not fight you.</v>

966
01:52:00.758 --> 01:52:04.011
<v vader>Give yourself to the dark side.</v>

967
01:52:05.345 --> 01:52:09.308
<v vader>It is the only way you can save your friends.</v>

968
01:52:10.726 --> 01:52:12.186
<v vader>Yes.</v>

969
01:52:12.352 --> 01:52:14.396
<v vader>Your thoughts betray you.</v>

970
01:52:14.563 --> 01:52:17.024
<v vader>Your feelings for them are strong,</v>

971
01:52:17.399 --> 01:52:18.942
<v vader>especially for...</v>

972
01:52:21.236 --> 01:52:22.780
<v vader>sister.</v>

973
01:52:24.072 --> 01:52:25.199
<v vader>So,</v>

974
01:52:25.240 --> 01:52:28.076
<v vader>you have a twin sister.</v>

975
01:52:28.660 --> 01:52:32.289
<v vader>Your feelings have now betrayed her, too.</v>

976
01:52:32.623 --> 01:52:36.460
<v vader>Obi-Wan was wise to hide her from me.</v>

977
01:52:36.627 --> 01:52:40.589
<v vader>Now his failure is complete.</v>

978
01:52:42.341 --> 01:52:45.677
<v vader>If you will not turn to the dark side,</v>

979
01:52:46.345 --> 01:52:49.306
<v vader>then perhaps she will.</v>

980
01:52:49.348 --> 01:52:50.390
<v luke>(YELLS) Never!</v>

981
01:53:35.686 --> 01:53:37.312
<v palpatine>Good!</v>

982
01:53:42.025 --> 01:53:44.736
<v palpatine>Your hate has made you powerful.</v>

983
01:53:45.779 --> 01:53:47.614
<v palpatine>Now,</v>

984
01:53:47.781 --> 01:53:50.242
<v palpatine>fulfill your destiny</v>

985
01:53:51.076 --> 01:53:54.997
<v palpatine>and take your father's place at my side.</v>

986
01:54:09.928 --> 01:54:11.179
<v luke>Never.</v>

987
01:54:14.474 --> 01:54:16.476
<v luke>I'll never turn to the dark side.</v>

988
01:54:19.771 --> 01:54:21.565
<v luke>You've failed, Your Highness.</v>

989
01:54:22.524 --> 01:54:24.318
<v luke>I am a Jedi,</v>

990
01:54:24.484 --> 01:54:26.528
<v luke>like my father before me.</v>

991
01:54:34.328 --> 01:54:35.996
<v palpatine>So be it,</v>

992
01:54:36.163 --> 01:54:37.331
<v palpatine>Jedi.</v>

993
01:54:38.123 --> 01:54:39.249
<v han>Move!</v>

994
01:54:39.416 --> 01:54:40.542
<v han>Move!</v>

995
01:54:52.596 --> 01:54:53.680
<v ackbar>The shield is down!</v>

996
01:54:53.722 --> 01:54:56.433
<v ackbar>Commence attack on the Death Star's main reactor!</v>

997
01:54:56.475 --> 01:54:57.768
<v lando>We're on our way.</v>

998
01:54:57.809 --> 01:55:00.270
<v lando>Red Group, Gold Group, all fighters follow me.</v>

999
01:55:00.312 --> 01:55:02.356
<v lando>I told you they'd do it!</v>

1000
01:55:09.237 --> 01:55:12.074
<v palpatine>If you will not be turned,</v>

1001
01:55:12.741 --> 01:55:15.452
<v palpatine>you will be destroyed.</v>

1002
01:55:22.459 --> 01:55:24.962
<v palpatine>Young fool.</v>

1003
01:55:25.128 --> 01:55:30.467
<v palpatine>Only now, at the end, do you understand.</v>

1004
01:55:43.397 --> 01:55:48.777
<v palpatine>Your feeble skills are no match for the power of the dark side.</v>

1005
01:55:52.990 --> 01:55:56.368
<v palpatine>You have paid the price for your lack of vision.</v>

1006
01:56:02.207 --> 01:56:03.792
<v luke>Father, please!</v>

1007
01:56:09.047 --> 01:56:10.757
<v luke>Help me!</v>

1008
01:56:19.391 --> 01:56:21.560
<v palpatine>Now, young Skywalker,</v>

1009
01:56:23.603 --> 01:56:25.397
<v palpatine>you will die.</v>

1010
01:56:51.465 --> 01:56:53.091
<v vader>No.</v>

1011
01:56:55.343 --> 01:56:56.636
No!

1012
01:57:48.355 --> 01:57:49.648
<v wedge>I'm going in.</v>

1013
01:57:52.943 --> 01:57:54.110
<v lando>Here goes nothing.</v>

1014
01:58:01.368 --> 01:58:03.328
<v lando>Now lock onto the strongest power source.</v>

1015
01:58:03.370 --> 01:58:05.247
<v lando>It should be the power generator.</v>

1016
01:58:07.582 --> 01:58:09.000
<v wedge>Form up. Stay alert.</v>

1017
01:58:09.042 --> 01:58:10.752
<v wedge>We could run out of space real fast.</v>

1018
01:58:26.601 --> 01:58:28.562
<v lando>Split up and head back to the surface.</v>

1019
01:58:28.603 --> 01:58:31.857
<v lando>See if you can get a few of those TIE fighters to follow you.</v>

1020
01:58:31.898 --> 01:58:32.941
<v role-pilot>Copy, Gold Leader.</v>

1021
01:58:43.201 --> 01:58:44.619
<v lando>That was too close.</v>

1022
01:58:48.748 --> 01:58:51.001
<v ackbar>We've got to give those fighters more time.</v>

1023
01:58:51.042 --> 01:58:54.171
<v ackbar>Concentrate all fire on that Super Star Destroyer.</v>

1024
01:59:00.135 --> 01:59:02.429
<v role-controller>Sir, we've lost our bridge deflector shields.</v>

1025
01:59:02.470 --> 01:59:04.139
<v piett>Intensify the forward batteries.</v>

1026
01:59:04.181 --> 01:59:05.661
<v piett>I don't want anything to get through!</v>

1027
01:59:08.018 --> 01:59:09.728
<v piett>Intensify forward firepower!</v>

1028
01:59:11.688 --> 01:59:13.148
<v role-commander>Too late!</v>

1029
01:59:56.274 --> 01:59:57.692
<v vader>Luke.</v>

1030
01:59:57.859 --> 02:00:01.321
<v vader>Help me take this mask off.</v>

1031
02:00:02.113 --> 02:00:04.532
<v luke>But you'll die.</v>

1032
02:00:04.699 --> 02:00:08.161
<v vader>Nothing can stop that now.</v>

1033
02:00:09.287 --> 02:00:10.872
<v vader>Just for once,</v>

1034
02:00:11.748 --> 02:00:17.045
<v vader>let me look on you with my own eyes.</v>

1035
02:00:53.248 --> 02:00:54.374
<v anakin>Now,</v>

1036
02:00:55.083 --> 02:00:57.002
<v anakin>go, my son.</v>

1037
02:00:59.462 --> 02:01:00.922
<v anakin>Leave me.</v>

1038
02:01:01.756 --> 02:01:03.675
<v luke>No. You're coming with me.</v>

1039
02:01:04.718 --> 02:01:06.803
<v luke>I'll not leave you here. I've got to save you.</v>

1040
02:01:07.679 --> 02:01:11.224
<v anakin>You already have, Luke.</v>

1041
02:01:12.517 --> 02:01:14.227
You were right.

1042
02:01:15.103 --> 02:01:17.647
<v anakin>You were right about me.</v>

1043
02:01:19.441 --> 02:01:21.151
<v anakin>Tell your sister</v>

1044
02:01:22.819 --> 02:01:25.071
<v anakin>you were right.</v>

1045
02:01:31.536 --> 02:01:32.662
<v luke>Father.</v>

1046
02:01:37.125 --> 02:01:38.376
<v luke>I won't leave you.</v>

1047
02:02:03.860 --> 02:02:04.903
<v wedge>There it is.</v>

1048
02:02:07.739 --> 02:02:10.217
<v lando>All right, Wedge, go for the power regulator on the north tower.</v>

1049
02:02:10.241 --> 02:02:13.286
<v wedge>Copy, Gold Leader. I'm already on my way out.</v>

1050
02:02:32.806 --> 02:02:35.225
<v ackbar>Move the fleet away from the Death Star.</v>

1051
02:03:23.481 --> 02:03:24.732
<v c-3po>They did it!</v>

1052
02:03:33.324 --> 02:03:35.660
<v han>I'm sure Luke wasn't on that thing when it blew.</v>

1053
02:03:37.370 --> 02:03:38.621
<v leia>He wasn't.</v>

1054
02:03:39.581 --> 02:03:41.499
<v leia>I can feel it.</v>

1055
02:03:45.837 --> 02:03:47.422
<v han>You love him.</v>

1056
02:03:50.717 --> 02:03:51.968
<v han>Don't you?</v>

1057
02:03:52.635 --> 02:03:53.761
<v leia>Yes.</v>

1058
02:03:54.220 --> 02:03:56.431
<v han>All right. I understand.</v>

1059
02:03:56.973 --> 02:03:58.099
<v han>Fine.</v>

1060
02:03:59.350 --> 02:04:00.894
<v han>When he comes back,</v>

1061
02:04:02.312 --> 02:04:03.771
<v han>I won't get in the way.</v>

1062
02:04:06.649 --> 02:04:08.359
<v leia>It's not like that at all.</v>

1063
02:04:11.654 --> 02:04:13.531
<v leia>He's my brother.</v>

1064
02:05:55.883 --> 02:05:57.927
<v gunray>Wesa free!</v>
